(400460, 15, 5, 'Grand Expedition Yak', 400460, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 400460, 6, 1, 'These beasts of burden are known to carry over five times their own weight and to be capable of lasting several days without food or water.', -1, 0),
