(400463, 15, 5, 'Amber Scorpion', 400463, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 400463, 6, 1, 'The Klaxxi ride massive scorpions into battle against their enemies. A carapace hardened by amber provides superior protection while on the battlefield.', -1, 0),
