(400481, 15, 5, 'Regal Riding Crane', 400481, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 400481, 6, 1, 'The crane is a symbol of wisdom and nobility. Their ability to carry us into the skies is nothing short of miraculous. - Jaluu the Generous', -1, 0),
