(400543, 15, 5, 'Clutch of Ji-Kun', 400543, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 400543, 6, 1, 'Although Ji-Kun feasted on the failed creations of mogu flesh-shapers, her progeny is willing to eat more pedestrian carcasses.', -1, 0),
