(402807, 15, 5, 'Brawlin\' Bruno', 402807, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402807, 6, 1, 'Said to be leaner and potentially even meaner than the venerable Bruce. Bruno\'s legacy is yet to be written.', -1, 0),
(402808, 15, 5, 'Ballistic Bronco', 402808, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402808, 6, 1, 'Ideal transportation for a Brawler that always hits their mark.', -1, 0),
(402815, 15, 5, 'Snowpaw Glimmerfur Prowler', 402815, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402815, 6, 1, 'The snowpaw inhabit the frigid afterlives of the Shadowlands, reveling in their frosty environment.', -1, 0),
(402817, 15, 5, 'Lucent Hawkstrider', 402817, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402817, 6, 1, 'A loyal creature of Thalassian nobility, it finds comfort holed up in the Magisters\' Terrace.', -1, 0),
(402818, 15, 5, 'Emerald Hawkstrider', 402818, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402818, 6, 1, 'Its rider died during battle, and so the saddle is passed to you.', -1, 0),
(402821, 15, 5, 'Venomous Gladiator\'s Goredrake', 402821, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402821, 6, 1, 'This armored mount makes everyone around you green with envy.', -1, 0),
(402823, 15, 5, 'Savage Crimson Battle Turtle', 402823, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402823, 6, 1, 'This savage turtle sees red at every turn. Though slow in speed, it is vital to remember that nothing can outrun a cannon.', -1, 0),
(402825, 15, 5, 'Cloudborn Razorwing', 402825, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402825, 6, 1, 'A very rare Korthian creature, due to limited cloud cover.', -1, 0),
(402827, 15, 5, 'Sanguine Harrower', 402827, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402827, 6, 1, 'A brutal aerial predator of the Voidstorm, the Sanguine Harrower makes up for its lack of stealth with a terrifying visage and hunting prowess.', -1, 0),
(402828, 15, 5, 'Voidbound Stormray', 402828, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402828, 6, 1, 'With its razor-sharp teeth, the Voidbound Stormray look eager to bite you. It will, but only if you let it.', -1, 0),
(402829, 15, 5, 'Lab-Grown Stormray', 402829, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402829, 6, 1, 'Through the intensive research in the Void, researchers were able to bring this stormray back to life completely tamed.', -1, 0),
(402831, 15, 5, 'Tenebrous Harrower', 402831, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402831, 6, 1, 'The fiercest harrowers of Voidstorm are often twisted by the void and bound to Xal\'atath\'s will.', -1, 0),
(402832, 15, 5, 'The Sire\'s Palanquin', 402832, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402832, 6, 1, 'This mount is so comfortable that you will sleep like the dead while riding it.', -1, 0),
(402833, 15, 5, 'Arboreal Pseudoshell', 402833, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402833, 6, 1, 'The plants of the deep lands often emulate the creatures of Azeroth. The purpose of the mimicry is unknown, but can be quite disturbing when the terrestrial mollusks are on the wrong end of an arboreal meal.', -1, 0),
(402834, 15, 5, 'Cabbage Pseudoshell', 402834, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402834, 6, 1, 'The plants of the deep lands often emulate the creatures of of Azeroth. The purpose of the mimicry is unknown, but can be quite disturbing when the terrestrial mollusks are on the wrong end of an arboreal meal.', -1, 0),
(402835, 15, 5, 'Lavender Pseudoshell', 402835, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402835, 6, 1, 'The plants of the deep lands often emulate the creatures of of Azeroth. The purpose of the mimicry is unknown, but can be quite disturbing when the terrestrial mollusks are on the wrong end of an arboreal meal.', -1, 0),
(402836, 15, 5, 'Accented Pseudoshell', 402836, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402836, 6, 1, 'The plants of the deep lands often emulate the creatures of of Azeroth. The purpose of the mimicry is unknown, but can be quite disturbing when the terrestrial mollusks are on the wrong end of an arboreal meal.', -1, 0),
(402837, 15, 5, 'Scarlet Lady', 402837, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402837, 6, 1, 'In life and in the after life the Scarlet Lady will get you where you need to go in style.', -1, 0),
(402838, 15, 5, 'Fantastical Goblin Waveshredder', 402838, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402838, 6, 1, 'When you\'re ready for fun you\'re ready for the Fantastical Goblin Waveshredder. Guaranteed to bring the fun. *Disclaimer: Fun not guaranteed', -1, 0),
(402839, 15, 5, 'Delver\'s Arcane Golem', 402839, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402839, 6, 1, 'Originally intended as a gift for Silvermoon, this construct was lost in transit near the shores of Gnarldor Isle.', -1, 0),
(402840, 15, 5, 'Silvermoon\'s Arcane Defender', 402840, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402840, 6, 1, 'A gilded variant of the Arcane Guardian, most often seen guarding the more opulent districts of Silvermoon City.', -1, 0),
(402841, 15, 5, 'Elven Arcane Guardian', 402841, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402841, 6, 1, 'Sworn defender of the Elven people, animated by arcane power and an unyielding will to protect.', -1, 0),
(402842, 15, 5, 'Arcanovoid Construct', 402842, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402842, 6, 1, 'The Void\'s influence is far-reaching and overpowering enough that even an Arcane Guardian can be made to kneel.', -1, 0),
(402843, 15, 5, 'Ghastropod', 402843, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402843, 6, 1, 'This snail make a deliberate decision to plunge itself into the slime canals of Undercity. It emerged bigger, stronger but not faster than before.', -1, 0),
(402845, 15, 5, 'Vicious Snapvine', 402845, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402845, 6, 1, 'The Snapvines have always been dangerous, but we never realized that the deep variants were independent, and could fly. This Snapvine is always wanting to see more of the world and be fed.', -1, 0),
(402846, 15, 5, 'Ferocious Snapvine', 402846, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402846, 6, 1, 'The Snapvines have always been dangerous, but we never realized that the deep variants were independent, and could fly. The fruit from this beast is especially delicious when baked in a pie.', -1, 0),
(402847, 15, 5, 'Blooded Snapvine', 402847, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402847, 6, 1, 'The Snapvines have always been dangerous, but we never realized that the deep variants were independent, and could fly. The distinct, bold coloring means the creature has eaten recently.', -1, 0),
(402848, 15, 5, 'Savage Snapvine', 402848, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402848, 6, 1, 'The Snapvines have always been dangerous, but we never realized that the deep variants were independent, and could fly. Why would anyone want to find one of those things, much less ride one? But the fruit is good.', -1, 0),
(402849, 15, 5, 'Hypo-Speed X6000', 402849, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402849, 6, 1, 'A compilation of nuts, bolts, gears, and treated wood paneling make for an unusually speedy ride.', -1, 0),
(402850, 15, 5, 'Fluffy Comfy Flying Quilt', 402850, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402850, 6, 1, 'Woven together by some of the finest Dalaran mages, this flying quilt is known for its comfort and fluffy pillows.', -1, 0),
(402851, 15, 5, 'Gruffy Comfy Flying Quilt', 402851, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402851, 6, 1, 'Woven together by some of the grumpiest Dalaran mages, this flying quilt is known for its comfort and fluffy pillows.', -1, 0),
(402852, 15, 5, 'Comfy Bel\'ameth Flying Quilt', 402852, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402852, 6, 1, 'Ainderu Summerleaf\'s hand-woven quilts are popular among the children of Bel\'ameth.', -1, 0),
(402853, 15, 5, 'Comfy Silvermoon Flying Quilt', 402853, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402853, 6, 1, 'Sempstress Ambershine\'s enchanted quilts became a must-buy trend for the noble-borne children of Silvermoon City.', -1, 0),
(402912, 15, 5, 'Vivacious Chloroceros', 402912, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402912, 6, 1, 'Catching a chloroceros mane leaf mid-air is considered a sign of good luck among the Haranir. The more vivacious the leaf, the greater the luck.', -1, 0),
(402913, 15, 5, 'Vivid Chloroceros', 402913, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402913, 6, 1, 'The healthier the chloroceros, the more vivid the foliage.', -1, 0),
(402914, 15, 5, 'Fel Spirehawk', 402914, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402914, 6, 1, 'Looking into the eyes of this mystical beast is like peering into the heart of a fel corrupted sun. Goggles are recommended when you\'re riding.', -1, 0),
(402915, 15, 5, 'Unbound Manawyrm', 402915, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402915, 6, 1, 'The turbulent void magics that have gripped the Sunwell are attracting the rare great manawyrms, corrupting them as they feed on the unbound magics.', -1, 0),
(402917, 15, 5, 'Anu\'shalla, Shadow\'s Guidance', 402917, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402917, 6, 1, 'Her wings cut through the sky like shadows on a moonlit night.', -1, 0),
(402922, 15, 5, 'Stoneforged Sentinel', 402922, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402922, 6, 1, 'Sometimes the right tool for the job cannot be simply pulled from a shelf. Craftsmen from across Azeroth have developed the Stoneforged Sentinel to address this need, allowing each to create the perfect guardian for the time and place it is used.', -1, 0),
(402926, 15, 5, 'Gilnean Iron Charger', 402926, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402926, 6, 1, 'This noble horse has seen some battles during the curse uprising.', -1, 0),
(402927, 15, 5, 'Gilnean Copper Charger', 402927, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402927, 6, 1, 'Carve through the night on this loyal, stalwart steed.', -1, 0),
(402928, 15, 5, 'Pyrewood Rebel\'s Rouncey', 402928, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402928, 6, 1, 'After diligent training from riders in both worgen and human forms, these horses will now bear any rider in Gilnean finery.', -1, 0),
(402929, 15, 5, 'Gilneas Loyalist\'s Rouncey', 402929, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402929, 6, 1, 'Steadfast and proud, this steed carries its rider with quiet dignity and unyielding resolve.', -1, 0),
(402930, 15, 5, 'Blossomback Arboon', 402930, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402930, 6, 1, 'Once a common sight in the mountains surrounding the Jade Forest, the arboon\'s return signals the forest may be healing.', -1, 0),
(402931, 15, 5, 'Amberback Arboon', 402931, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402931, 6, 1, 'The golden blossoms of the amberback arboon are a sign of its age and wisdom. A rarity among rarities, even seeing one is considered good luck.', -1, 0),
(402933, 15, 5, 'Magister\'s Spell Bee', 402933, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402933, 6, 1, 'A few Silvermoon Magisters once dedicated their arcane thesis to the study of infusing local flora with arcane-flecked pollen and the effects it had on pollinator species. To the Grand Magister, it was a success. To Silvermoon\'s Gardeners, it was not.', -1, 0),
(402935, 15, 5, 'Void-Touched Hawkstrider', 402935, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402935, 6, 1, 'Almost no beasts are immune to the void\'s touch. A few of our scouts\' hawkstriders have been affected by the void. I have been observing them now for a bit and they are still fit for service.', -1, 0),
(402937, 15, 5, 'Zothwing Darkseeker', 402937, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402937, 6, 1, 'Do not let its cloying looks fool you--zothwing darkseekers are a remnant of an ancient Black Empire species. Pay no attention to whispers mentioning "snackies" for your "trusty mount."', -1, 0),
(402938, 15, 5, 'Zothwing Deepseeker', 402938, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402938, 6, 1, 'A gift of N\'Zoth, Zothwing Deepseekers are as at home in the crushing depths of Azeroth\'s oceans as they are in the bitter cold of the void.', -1, 0),
(402940, 15, 5, 'Dusk-Painted Sun Roc', 402940, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402940, 6, 1, 'Long ago, the dusk-painted silhouettes of these sun rocs inspired many fireside myths. Their return to Kalimdor has reignited lost stories of these heralds of An\'she.', -1, 0),
(402941, 15, 5, 'Flame-Painted Sun Roc', 402941, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402941, 6, 1, 'In ages past, the sun rocs of Kalimdor were believed to be the messengers of An\'she, carrying with them the first flame before dawn and the final light of evenfall.', -1, 0),
(402948, 15, 5, 'Golden Ashened Cataclysm', 402948, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402948, 6, 1, 'In the corners of Azeroth, stories are told of a dreaded dragon who swept a pall of torment over the land. In some versions of this story, his fiery presence brought cataclysmic death and destruction worldwide. In other versions, he is blue.', -1, 0),
(402949, 15, 5, 'Sha-Warped Riding Wolf', 402949, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402949, 6, 1, 'Sha has warped this wolf into an even more fearsome creature. The emotions that flow through this creature make it an unmistakable harbinger of doom.', -1, 0),
(402950, 15, 5, 'Luminous Sporeglider', 402950, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402950, 6, 1, 'This sporeglider\'s voracious appetite for luminescent spores has lent it an exquisite glow.', -1, 0),
(402951, 15, 5, 'Sha-Warped Owl', 402951, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402951, 6, 1, 'Sha has warped this owl into an even more fearsome creature. The emotions that flow through this creature make it an unmistakable harbinger of doom.', -1, 0),
(402961, 15, 5, 'Void-Corrupted Hex Eagle', 402961, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402961, 6, 1, 'A vile ritual can give the ritual master great power. It can also give the target of the ritual great power. This can sometimes go well or poorly for the ritual master.', -1, 0),
(402964, 15, 5, 'Void-Touched Snapdragon', 402964, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402964, 6, 1, 'The snapdragon is a resilient creature and loyal by nature. This has made them preferred companions of the naga. However, their latest ritual has made this snapdragon ready for a new home.', -1, 0),
(402965, 15, 5, 'Void-Corrupted Lynx', 402965, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402965, 6, 1, 'The Eversong lynxes are known for their curiosity and this one especially. Sneaking into supply stores, and treasure boxes around ritual sites has changed it forever. Anyone who manages to leash it will have a feisty mount on their hands.', -1, 0),
(402972, 15, 5, 'Spring Panda', 402972, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402972, 6, 1, 'Equipped with bamboo tools, food and a napping cub, the Spring Panda is ready for an amazing adventure.', -1, 0),
(402973, 15, 5, 'Blackwater X-TREME Firework Rocket', 402973, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402973, 6, 1, 'There is no guarantee this rocket will get you where you want to go in one piece. Warning: Rockets explode!', -1, 0),
(402975, 15, 5, 'Bilgewater X-TREME Firework Rocket', 402975, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402975, 6, 1, 'The engineers of Undermine were so preoccupied with whether or not they COULD make a faster rocket, they didn\'t stop to think if they should.', -1, 0),
(402977, 15, 5, 'Sunflare Driftmoth', 402977, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402977, 6, 1, 'Although they offer some of the smoothest rides of any mounts in the world, the Sunflare Driftmoth are rare to find in the wild, and rarer still to tame.', -1, 0),
(402980, 15, 5, 'Spirit of Tok\'jara', 402980, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402980, 6, 1, 'Now freed from the curse, the great eagle Tok\'jara continues to serve the Amani even through death.', -1, 0),
(402981, 15, 5, 'Tuskarr Hermit Crab', 402981, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402981, 6, 1, 'This crab longs to see the world alongside its Tidesworn Elder. The elder is happy to pay you for your troubles through the granting of Tidesworn Augment Runes.', -1, 0),
(402982, 15, 5, 'Hearthkeeper\'s Wandering Caravan', 402982, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402982, 6, 1, 'Comfortable as your own home and adventurous as a tortollan trader, the Hearthkeeper\'s Wandering Caravan will carry you in luxurious style anywhere your travels on Azeroth take you.', -1, 0),
(402984, 15, 5, 'Rabbit\'ath', 402984, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402984, 6, 1, 'The presence of Rabbit\'ath brings doom and despair to all who witness. Legend says that in its eyes, you can glimpse the end of all things.', -1, 0),
(402988, 15, 5, 'Voidmancer\'s Starcarver', 402988, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402988, 6, 1, 'This pinnacle of Voidmancer transport technology was once a symbol of status and power among high ranking domanaar. After its creator mysteriously vanished, it was viewed as unseemly when used on core worlds gatherings.', -1, 0),
(402990, 15, 5, 'Netherforged Nullframe', 402990, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402990, 6, 1, 'Assembled by the Lightforged, sundered by the Hal\'hadar, and restored by a Technomancer. A matrix of light, void, and arcane swirls within this renewed Warframe.', -1, 0),
(402994, 15, 5, 'Badlands Buzzard', 402994, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 402994, 6, 1, 'The white buzzards are some of the rarest in all the Badlands. Rumor has it that one may even be caught and tamed to fight alongside hunters.', -1, 0),
(403002, 15, 5, 'Vicious Lightbloom Boar', 403002, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403002, 6, 1, 'Motes of energy surround this mount, occasionally reflecting a ray of light across your vision.', -1, 0),
(403003, 15, 5, 'Vicious Lightbloom Boar', 403003, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403003, 6, 1, 'Motes of energy surround this mount, occasionally reflecting a ray of light across your vision.', -1, 0),
(403004, 15, 5, 'Autumnal Witchwick\'s Rider', 403004, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403004, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403005, 15, 5, 'Cerulean Deathwalker', 403005, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403005, 6, 1, 'A frozen tide of wailing souls, locked in cerulean ice, grinds onward under the weight of eternal suffering.', -1, 0),
(403006, 15, 5, 'Amethyst Mechsuit', 403006, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403006, 6, 1, 'Where diamond reflects perfection, amethyst resonates with power.', -1, 0),
(403007, 15, 5, 'Blue-Chip Shreddertank', 403007, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403007, 6, 1, 'It may not be exciting, but it makes money every time.', -1, 0),
(403008, 15, 5, 'Profit-Green Shreddertank', 403008, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403008, 6, 1, 'If it\'s leaking, it\'s working.', -1, 0),
(403009, 15, 5, 'Speculative Shreddertank', 403009, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403009, 6, 1, 'The numbers look great if it doesn\'t explode.', -1, 0),
(403010, 15, 5, 'High-Yield Shreddertank', 403010, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403010, 6, 1, 'High return. High risk. Non-refundable.', -1, 0),
(403014, 15, 5, 'Mossy Witchwick\'s Rider', 403014, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403014, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403015, 15, 5, 'Moonlit Witchwick\'s Rider', 403015, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403015, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403016, 15, 5, 'Scarlet Witchwick\'s Rider', 403016, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403016, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403017, 15, 5, 'Blushing Witchwick\'s Rider', 403017, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403017, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403018, 15, 5, 'Carmine Witchwick\'s Rider', 403018, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403018, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403019, 15, 5, 'Sea-Dwelling Isle Serpent', 403019, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403019, 6, 1, 'This oozing serpent has a taste for fish. As long as you can feed them, they should remain friendly. Should.', -1, 0),
(403020, 15, 5, 'Caustic Venomfang', 403020, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403020, 6, 1, 'This venomfang\'s toxins are potent enough to liquidate its prey in seconds.', -1, 0),
(403021, 15, 5, 'Crimson Venomfang', 403021, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403021, 6, 1, 'A venomfang\'s most deadly weapon is its terrifying tail, which can mortally envenom its prey with a mere scratch.', -1, 0),
(403023, 15, 5, 'Auriferous Venomfang', 403023, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403023, 6, 1, 'Its stealth foiled by bright scales, this venomfang lurks among hidden treasure for the next meal.', -1, 0),
(403029, 15, 5, 'Apophic Soul Crusher', 403029, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403029, 6, 1, 'Once powered by the arcane, now fueled solely by the tortured spirits of the unfaithful.', -1, 0),
(403030, 15, 5, 'Primeval Skyfriend', 403030, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403030, 6, 1, 'The most vicious elder skyfiends lurk within the confines of the Venomous Abyss, surfacing only to stalk prey across the shores of Atal\'Utek before returning to their fetid lairs. This one has become your sky-friend.', -1, 0),
(403031, 15, 5, 'Hexflame Reaver', 403031, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403031, 6, 1, 'Its glow is a warning: the hunt is already over.', -1, 0),
(403032, 15, 5, 'Preyhunter\'s Fury', 403032, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403032, 6, 1, 'You don\'t follow tracks; you follow the fading green fire.', -1, 0),
(403033, 15, 5, 'Tortured Gorger', 403033, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403033, 6, 1, 'Both domanaar and ethereals have tried to cage this devourer. Each time they have failed. Now, soaked in the energies of the void, this tormented gorger is ready to unleash havoc.', -1, 0),
(403034, 15, 5, 'Living Heartsbane Cauldron', 403034, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403034, 6, 1, 'The wicker constructs of the drust are both deadly and useful. In the case of the Living Heartsbane Cauldron, a cunning witch can both brew and travel simultaneously.', -1, 0),
(403036, 15, 5, 'Sun Festival\'s Painted Roc', 403036, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403036, 6, 1, 'Long ago, this elusive summer roc inspired many legends, many believing them to be descendants of phoenixes. The ancient tauren saw these majestic creatures as living manifestations of An\'she\'s fire.', -1, 0),
(403043, 15, 5, 'Corroded Soul Crusher', 403043, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403043, 6, 1, 'Aeons passed without leaving a mark upon its arcane frame. It took the corrosive ichor of Ula\'Tek to finally erode what eternity could not.', -1, 0),
(403044, 15, 5, 'Shadow Spirehawk', 403044, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403044, 6, 1, 'Looking into the eyes of this mystical beast is like peering into a solar eclipse. Goggles are recommended when you\'re riding.', -1, 0),
(403051, 15, 5, 'Topaz Skyfang', 403051, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403051, 6, 1, 'This elusive wind serpent likes to hide in the forest canopy before stooping down on unsuspecting prey.', -1, 0),
(403053, 15, 5, 'Emerald Skyfang', 403053, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403053, 6, 1, 'Found patrolling the skies of Atal\'Utek, maintaining the peace and a full stomach.', -1, 0),
(403054, 15, 5, 'Violet-Backed Skyfang', 403054, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403054, 6, 1, 'The wind serpents of Atal\'Utek have venomous tails. You can thank Ula\'tek for that.', -1, 0),
(403058, 15, 5, 'The Writhing Brood', 403058, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403058, 6, 1, 'A grotesque conglomerate of serpents, it has yielded to you after witnessing your battle against The Writhing Coil.', -1, 0),
(403060, 15, 5, 'Indigo Coiled Horror', 403060, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403060, 6, 1, 'Writhes have three distinct temperaments, making them three times as difficult to tame.', -1, 0),
(403061, 15, 5, 'Ruby Writhe', 403061, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403061, 6, 1, 'Riding on a writhe makes it thrice as nice.', -1, 0),
(403062, 15, 5, 'Venomous Coiler', 403062, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403062, 6, 1, 'A native of the deadly venom pits within the Vaults of Atal\'Utek, this monstrosity poisons the air it slithers past.', -1, 0),
(403063, 15, 5, 'Breath of Blight', 403063, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403063, 6, 1, 'A sickly haze trails in its wake, poisoning earth, air, and anything foolish enough to pursue it.', -1, 0),
(403064, 15, 5, 'Breath of Ruin', 403064, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403064, 6, 1, 'Where its shadow falls, even the bravest hear the echo of forgotten wars.', -1, 0),
(403066, 15, 5, 'Corrupted Swarmer', 403066, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403066, 6, 1, 'The Aqir swarmers feast on heroes and cowards alike to grow their ranks.', -1, 0),
(403069, 15, 5, 'Umbral Ashes', 403069, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403069, 6, 1, 'Its flames consume all but the worthy.', -1, 0),
(403102, 15, 5, 'Crested Ember Leafmimic', 403102, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403102, 6, 1, 'This sturdy leafmimic can be found only in the warmest of areas. Its red scales allow it to hide undiscovered in the heated alcoves it prefers.', -1, 0),
(403103, 15, 5, 'Crested Aqua Leafmimic', 403103, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403103, 6, 1, 'The aqua leafmimic is a rare sight indeed. Found only in the forests of Ashenvale, its darkened scales allow it to hide among the trees and groves undetected.', -1, 0),
(403104, 15, 5, 'Crested Verdant Leafmimic', 403104, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403104, 6, 1, 'Found primarily in areas with dense vegetation, this leafmimic is rarely spotted due to the natural hues of its scales, allowing it to blend in with its surroundings.', -1, 0),
(403105, 15, 5, 'Crested Violet Leafmimic', 403105, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403105, 6, 1, 'The violet leafmimic can be found in most dense jungles -- but only if your eyesight is keen. The patterns on their scales allow them to blend in with the vibrant foliage and shadows.', -1, 0),
(403107, 15, 5, 'Cerulean Prideclaw', 403107, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403107, 6, 1, 'A fierce and loyal mount that will accompany you on all your journeys.', -1, 0),
(403119, 15, 5, 'Wintry Witchwick\'s Rider', 403119, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403119, 6, 1, 'Sleek, stylish, and spooky, the Witchwick Rider offers a smooth and surprisingly comfortable ride, thanks to the ergonomic saddle requested by many a spellcaster seeking cushioned support.', -1, 0),
(403125, 15, 5, 'Veteran Adventurer\'s Loyal Companion', 403125, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403125, 6, 1, 'When it is time to answer the call to adventure, this bear will be ready to take you there.', -1, 0),
(403137, 15, 5, 'Sporebearer Fungal Strider', 403137, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403137, 6, 1, 'Stride in style and bring the fun on this massive mount. Speak to Hoshena in the Den in Harandar to select what passengers will accompany you on your journeys.', -1, 0),
(403138, 15, 5, 'Hot Motocross Bunmover 4000', 403138, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403138, 6, 1, 'Warning: Contents may be hot and delicious.', -1, 0),
(403139, 15, 5, 'Hot Motocross Bunmover 4200', 403139, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403139, 6, 1, 'Warning: Contents may be hot and delicious.', -1, 0),
(403141, 15, 5, 'Hot Motocross Bunmover 4400', 403141, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403141, 6, 1, 'Riding the line between Sweet and Savory Avenue.', -1, 0),
(403142, 15, 5, 'Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600', 403142, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403142, 6, 1, 'When dessert manufacturing meets speed optimization. Intact bun delivery not guaranteed.', -1, 0),
(403144, 15, 5, 'Loa-Blessed Wayfarer', 403144, 4, 0, 0, 0, 20, 762, 75, 0, 55884, -1, 403144, 6, 1, 'A construct as ancient as the loa themselves, tasked with ferrying spirits unto De Other Side.', -1, 0),
(410115, 15, 2, 'Land Shark', 410115, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410115, 6, 0, 'After birth, newborn sharks quickly flee their hungry mothers. Their early independence makes them dangerous, even while young.', -1, 4096),
(410261, 15, 2, 'Personal World Destroyer', 410261, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410261, 6, 0, 'Goblin engineering at its finest. Blueprints based on the massive fel reaver in Hellfire Peninsula.', -1, 4096),
(410262, 15, 2, 'De-Weaponized Mechanical Companion', 410262, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410262, 6, 0, 'The gold standard for sturdy gnomish design, this mechanical critter is the perfect companion for the lonely engineer on the go.', -1, 4096),
(410264, 15, 2, 'Crawling Claw', 410264, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410264, 6, 0, 'This appears to be nothing more than the paw of a small primate. A closer inspection shows that the hand has been dried by centuries of exposure to the sands of Uldum.', -1, 4096),
(410266, 15, 2, 'Fossilized Hatchling', 410266, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410266, 6, 0, 'You stare at her, and she just stares right back. So clever; sometimes it seems as if she\'s figuring out how to open doors.', -1, 4096),
(410267, 15, 2, 'Enchanted Lantern', 410267, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410267, 6, 0, 'Reduces the likelihood of being eaten by monsters when you enter pitch-black places.', -1, 4096),
(410268, 15, 2, 'Lil\' Deathwing', 410268, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410268, 6, 0, 'Nations tremble under his shadow - the Destroyer, the one-time Aspect of Earth, and the monster responsible for breaking Azeroth asunder. Now in a convenient travel-size!', -1, 4096),
(410271, 15, 2, 'Rustberg Gull', 410271, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410271, 6, 0, 'This bird is a salty veteran of the endless naval battles surrounding Tol Barad--a veteran whose grown plump from picking through the leftovers, that is.', -1, 4096),
(410278, 15, 2, 'Fox Kit', 410278, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410278, 6, 0, 'The fighting in Tol Barad has made it difficult to find these kits, and numerous would-be owners have decimated the fox population there as a result.', -1, 4096),
(410279, 15, 2, 'Tiny Shale Spider', 410279, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410279, 6, 0, 'The elemental shale spider is no true arachnid, but it has durability and ferocity that make it feared even in Deepholm.', -1, 4096),
(410286, 15, 2, 'Mr. Grubbs', 410286, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410286, 6, 0, 'The grubs of the Plaguelands are a side effect of necromantic corruption and the massive number of corpses there. Mr. Grubbs is from a particularly acrobatic breed.', -1, 4096),
(410289, 15, 2, 'Scooter the Snail', 410289, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410289, 6, 0, 'You\'ll find him in his shell, exactly where a snail has to be!', -1, 4096),
(410291, 15, 2, 'Singing Sunflower', 410291, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410291, 6, 0, 'This sweet flower will brighten your day with its warm smile and cheerful song! Also strong against undead.', -1, 4096),
(410292, 15, 2, 'Magic Lamp', 410292, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410292, 6, 0, 'Higitus figi- hockity pocki- abracadab- prestidig--oh, pinfeathers!', -1, 4096),
(410293, 15, 2, 'Elementium Geode', 410293, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410293, 6, 0, 'Often confused by miners as a rare gem, the geode initially makes its presence known by emitting melodic reverberations.', -1, 4096),
(410294, 15, 2, 'Deathy', 410294, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410294, 6, 0, 'Deathwing\'s emergence transformed the whole of Azeroth; not even the ocean-dwelling murlocs were immune to his corrupt influence.', -1, 4096),
(410296, 15, 2, 'Moonkin Hatchling', 410296, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410296, 6, 0, 'Moonkin are blessed by Elune and spread nature\'s grace wherever they travel. The festive fowls are always in the mood for a dance.', -1, 4096),
(410297, 15, 2, 'Lil\' Ragnaros', 410297, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410297, 6, 0, 'It\'s never too soon to summon this tiny aspect of the dread Firelord.', -1, 4096),
(410301, 15, 2, 'Panther Cub', 410301, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410301, 6, 0, 'It looked up at you with those huge black eyes and seemed to ask, \'Are you my mommy?\'', -1, 4096),
(410303, 15, 2, 'Nightsaber Cub', 410303, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410303, 6, 0, 'Elune made nightsabers silver and black so they could meld into the shadows on a moonlit night.', -1, 4096),
(410306, 15, 2, 'Winterspring Cub', 410306, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410306, 6, 0, 'Winterspring cubs are happiest when frolicking in freshly fallen snow.', -1, 4096),
(410311, 15, 2, 'Guardian Cub', 410311, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410311, 6, 0, 'Still a little clumsy, this tiny winged lion is learning how to be the best mount it can be!', -1, 4096),
(410319, 15, 2, 'Feline Familiar', 410319, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410319, 6, 0, 'Ride with the moon (and this furry, whiskered witch) in the dead of night!', -1, 4096),
(410323, 15, 2, 'Nuts', 410323, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410323, 6, 0, 'Most squirrels hoard acorns for sustenance. Nuts, on the other hand, hoards acorns to stock its supply of ammunition.', -1, 4096),
(410328, 15, 2, 'Purple Puffer', 410328, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410328, 6, 0, 'You might think this fish out of water would be a weak opponent... until you see the intensity that lies within its protective bubble.', -1, 4096),
(410329, 15, 2, 'Murkablo', 410329, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410329, 6, 0, 'When you\'re confronting Murkablo or any of the Prime Murlocs, possession of a soulstone is strongly advised.', -1, 4096),
(410330, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Monkey', 410330, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410330, 6, 0, 'The monkeys of Azeroth are infamous tricksters, and these beloved companions of the Darkmoon Faire have taken that innate cunning to a whole new level.', -1, 4096),
(410331, 15, 2, 'Alliance Balloon', 410331, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410331, 6, 0, 'Created to entertain children at the Darkmoon Faire, these magical balloons never lose their floatiness.', -1, 4096),
(410332, 15, 2, 'Horde Balloon', 410332, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410332, 6, 0, 'A magical wonder, these balloons will never deflate and are traditionally created in batches of ninety-nine.', -1, 4096),
(410333, 15, 2, 'Gregarious Grell', 410333, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410333, 6, 0, 'The grell are embodiments of the wild side of nature. Tame ones are very rare.', -1, 4096),
(410335, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Turtle', 410335, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410335, 6, 0, 'This shelled reptile bravely protects the home on its back with an unwaveringly happy disposition.', -1, 4096),
(410336, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Balloon', 410336, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410336, 6, 0, 'It just floats along...', -1, 4096),
(410340, 15, 2, 'Sea Pony', 410340, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410340, 6, 0, 'Despite its diminutive size, it is impossible to miss a sea pony cutting through the water.', -1, 4096),
(410341, 15, 2, 'Lunar Lantern', 410341, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410341, 6, 0, 'These magical lanterns are acquired at the Lunar Festival, which celebrates the defeat of the Burning Legion by the free races of Azeroth.', -1, 4096),
(410342, 15, 2, 'Festival Lantern', 410342, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410342, 6, 0, 'The light from each lantern honors the soul of an ancestor spirit. During the Lunar Festival, these ghostly elders pass along their wisdom to the current generation.', -1, 4096),
(410343, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Cub', 410343, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410343, 6, 0, 'This snuggly kitten loves to frolic, but sometimes it seems to be chasing things that aren\'t really there.', -1, 4096),
(410346, 15, 2, 'Fetish Shaman', 410346, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410346, 6, 0, 'Fetish shaman are empowered by the spirits of their fallen ancestors. These malevolent spirits are bound to the shaman\'s tribal spear. Control this spear, and you control the shaman.', -1, 4096),
(410347, 15, 2, 'Soul of the Aspects', 410347, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410347, 6, 0, 'The Soul of the Aspects is said to be possessed of mercurial moods ranging from stoic and deliberate to unpredictable and erratic, to loving and deeply pensive.', -1, 4096),
(410374, 15, 2, 'Black Lamb', 410374, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410374, 6, 0, 'Offspring of the black sheep, the black lamb is only found in the forests of Elwynn.', -1, 4096),
(410378, 15, 2, 'Rabbit', 410378, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410378, 6, 0, 'When you have two rabbits, you\'ll often soon have three.', -1, 4096),
(410379, 15, 2, 'Squirrel', 410379, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410379, 6, 0, 'Most people do not know the difference between a squirrel and a chipmunk. Most don\'t care.', -1, 4096),
(410380, 15, 2, 'Bucktooth Flapper', 410380, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410380, 6, 0, 'It\'s hard to know what\'s more dangerous: the teeth or the tail.', -1, 4096),
(410381, 15, 2, 'Porcupette', 410381, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410381, 6, 0, 'Despite the name you should absolutely never, ever pet it.', -1, 4096),
(410382, 15, 2, 'Sun Darter Hatchling', 410382, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410382, 6, 0, 'This unique species of faerie dragon is not usually found on Azeroth.', -1, 4096),
(410383, 15, 2, 'Eternal Strider', 410383, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410383, 6, 0, 'It seems like a trick to the eyes, but the eternal strider can walk across water, its small feet never breaking the surface.', -1, 4096),
(410385, 15, 2, 'Mouse', 410385, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410385, 6, 0, 'It seems that mice are completely incapable of resisting cheese even in the face of imprisonment, injury, or death.', -1, 4096),
(410386, 15, 2, 'Prairie Dog', 410386, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410386, 6, 0, 'Distinct from their tree dwelling cousins, these ground squirrels make their homes on the plains of Azeroth and beyond.', -1, 4096),
(410388, 15, 2, 'Shore Crab', 410388, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410388, 6, 0, 'These arthropods line many Azerothian shores and seek to fulfill their one true desire: to pinch.', -1, 4096),
(410391, 15, 2, 'Mountain Cottontail', 410391, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410391, 6, 0, 'Mountain cottontails can leap up a steep incline with speed you would not believe.', -1, 4096),
(410392, 15, 2, 'Redridge Rat', 410392, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410392, 6, 0, 'The rats in Redridge grow fat from feasting on the bounty of the village larders.', -1, 4096),
(410396, 15, 2, 'Dusk Spiderling', 410396, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410396, 6, 0, 'Native to Duskwood, these eight-legged critters are often used as ingredients in alchemy potions.', -1, 4096),
(410398, 15, 2, 'Black Rat', 410398, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410398, 6, 0, 'While many people believe black cats to be bad luck, black rats are held in higher esteem.', -1, 4096),
(410400, 15, 2, 'Widow Spiderling', 410400, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410400, 6, 0, 'Widow spiderlings have plenty of time to explore Duskwood once they take care of their pesky family commitments.', -1, 4096),
(410401, 15, 2, 'Strand Crab', 410401, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410401, 6, 0, 'The low tide reveals the colonies of strand crabs and the sound of their clicking dance as they feed upon small creatures hidden in the sand.', -1, 4096),
(410402, 15, 2, 'Swamp Moth', 410402, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410402, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell in wet, muddy areas and feed on Sorrowmoss nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410404, 15, 2, 'Long-Tailed Mole', 410404, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410404, 6, 0, 'Thought by many to be nothing more than the subject of children\'s nursery rhymes, the long-tailed mole is very much real.', -1, 4096),
(410406, 15, 2, 'Beetle', 410406, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410406, 6, 0, 'A hardy insect that can dwell in just about any climate, the beetle is known to thrive on battlefields after the fighting has ended.', -1, 4096),
(410407, 15, 2, 'Forest Spiderling', 410407, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410407, 6, 0, 'This vicious species weaves elaborate webs throughout the dense jungles of Stranglethorn Vale.', -1, 4096),
(410408, 15, 2, 'Lizard Hatchling', 410408, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410408, 6, 0, 'If a female lizard does not lay her clutch in a well camouflaged area, her eggs will likely be devoured by Lashtail Raptors.', -1, 4096),
(410410, 15, 2, 'Wharf Rat', 410410, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410410, 6, 0, 'Just like the rough and tumble sailors who live dockside, the wharf rats are feral, violent creatures.', -1, 4096),
(410412, 15, 2, 'Spider', 410412, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410412, 6, 0, 'The most common of the arachnid family, these critters spin their webs in nearly every corner of Azeroth.', -1, 4096),
(410415, 15, 2, 'Fire Beetle', 410415, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410415, 6, 0, 'Drawn to heat and the smell of smoke, the fire beetle\'s diet consists of ash.', -1, 4096),
(410417, 15, 2, 'Rat', 410417, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410417, 6, 0, 'The intrepid archaeologist Harrison Jones has a well documented fear of rats.', -1, 4096),
(410419, 15, 2, 'Small Frog', 410419, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410419, 6, 0, 'This is a small frog.', -1, 4096),
(410420, 15, 2, 'Toad', 410420, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410420, 6, 0, 'The song of late summer nights is the song of toads.', -1, 4096),
(410421, 15, 2, 'Crimson Moth', 410421, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410421, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell in humid, tropical areas and feed on Kingsblood nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410423, 15, 2, 'Lava Crab', 410423, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410423, 6, 0, 'The thick exoskeleton of this adaptable arthropod allows it to thrive in harsh environments.', -1, 4096),
(410427, 15, 2, 'Ash Spiderling', 410427, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410427, 6, 0, 'The rock-hard carapaces of these spiders allow them to survive in the Searing Gorge\'s blistering heat.', -1, 4096),
(410428, 15, 2, 'Molten Hatchling', 410428, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410428, 6, 0, 'These blisteringly hot spiders camouflage themselves by blending in with oozing magma.', -1, 4096),
(410429, 15, 2, 'Lava Beetle', 410429, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410429, 6, 0, 'Beetles in the Burning Steppes roll magma into tiny balls and eat them once they cool off.', -1, 4096),
(410430, 15, 2, 'Gold Beetle', 410430, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410430, 6, 0, 'Tiny, autonomous machines created by the Titans to clean and maintain their mighty edifices.', -1, 4096),
(410433, 15, 2, 'Spiky Lizard', 410433, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410433, 6, 0, 'The coloration of the spiky lizard allows it to blend in seamlessly with the desert sands of Silithus.', -1, 4096),
(410440, 15, 2, 'Snow Cub', 410440, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410440, 6, 0, 'The thick snow near Dun Morogh acts as camouflage for snow cubs learning to hunt.', -1, 4096),
(410441, 15, 2, 'Alpine Hare', 410441, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410441, 6, 0, 'The alpine hare can burrow into the permafrost and hibernate for weeks or even months.', -1, 4096),
(410443, 15, 2, 'Grasslands Cottontail', 410443, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410443, 6, 0, 'Despite their idyllic surroundings, grasslands cottontails hop at surprising speed when evading their pursuers.', -1, 4096),
(410446, 15, 2, 'Jade Oozeling', 410446, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410446, 6, 0, 'Jade Oozelings glow in the dark, making them a welcome sight to workers in pitch-black mineshafts.', -1, 4096),
(410448, 15, 2, 'Hare', 410448, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410448, 6, 0, 'A carrot, a box, a stick, and some string. Wait a few hours and you\'ll have a hare.', -1, 4096),
(410449, 15, 2, 'Brown Marmot', 410449, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410449, 6, 0, 'Distinct from their Azerothian relatives, these critters of Outland make their home in Blade\'s Edge Mountains.', -1, 4096),
(410450, 15, 2, 'Maggot', 410450, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410450, 6, 0, 'The preferred habitat of this creature is woodland areas where it can safely complete its metamorphosis.', -1, 4096),
(410452, 15, 2, 'Red-Tailed Chipmunk', 410452, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410452, 6, 0, 'According to the tales of the night elves, the first red-tailed chipmunk was colored so after the theft and consumption of a sacred apple.', -1, 4096),
(410454, 15, 2, 'Undercity Rat', 410454, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410454, 6, 0, 'Even the rats of Lordaeron fell to the apothecaries\' plague, chewing upon the tainted flesh of the dead.', -1, 4096),
(410455, 15, 2, 'Blighted Squirrel', 410455, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410455, 6, 0, 'Undead squirrels have acquired a taste for the strange berries and mushrooms that now grow in Silverpine Forest.', -1, 4096),
(410457, 15, 2, 'Festering Maggot', 410457, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410457, 6, 0, 'It can swallow three times its own body weight in blood.', -1, 4096),
(410459, 15, 2, 'Cat', 410459, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410459, 6, 0, 'After centuries of domestication, these furry critters inhabit nearly every human nation in the Eastern Kingdoms.', -1, 4096),
(410461, 15, 2, 'Larva', 410461, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410461, 6, 0, 'This new arrival to Azeroth was spawned a short time ago. It seeks to thrive while awaiting its next phase of evolution.', -1, 4096),
(410463, 15, 2, 'Spirit Crab', 410463, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410463, 6, 0, 'The souls of slain crabs seek vengeance against the murlocs who ate them.', -1, 4096),
(410466, 15, 2, 'Spiny Lizard', 410466, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410466, 6, 0, 'The children of Orgrimmar frequently capture these lizards as pets. The adults of Orgrimmar frequently step on them.', -1, 4096),
(410467, 15, 2, 'Dung Beetle', 410467, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410467, 6, 0, 'A desert dwelling forager attracted to areas rich with dung.', -1, 4096),
(410468, 15, 2, 'Creepy Crawly', 410468, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410468, 6, 0, 'These beetles often make their homes in quarries abandoned by the Horde war machine in Durotar.', -1, 4096),
(410469, 15, 2, 'Twilight Beetle', 410469, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410469, 6, 0, 'An enigmatic species, said to feed off the chaotic energies of the Old Gods.', -1, 4096),
(410470, 15, 2, 'Twilight Spider', 410470, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410470, 6, 0, 'Twisted by the Twilight Hammer\'s dark magic, these sinister critters are known to feed on their own young.', -1, 4096),
(410472, 15, 2, 'Rabid Nut Varmint 5000', 410472, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410472, 6, 0, 'Considered by most to be a significant improvement to the 4000 series, there were nonetheless serious concerns about the amount of heat they produced.', -1, 4096),
(410473, 15, 2, 'Turquoise Turtle', 410473, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410473, 6, 0, 'Turtles are feared by the naga, who consider them bad luck and give them a wide berth on the shores of Azshara.', -1, 4096),
(410474, 15, 2, 'Cheetah Cub', 410474, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410474, 6, 0, 'These playful feline cubs practice their hunting skills by stalking each other through the Barrens.', -1, 4096),
(410478, 15, 2, 'Forest Moth', 410478, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410478, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell in cool, forested areas and feed on Mageroyal nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410479, 15, 2, 'Elfin Rabbit', 410479, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410479, 6, 0, 'Their proximity to the magic of the elves has caused some of them unnatural long life. And in some elfin rabbits...stranger things.', -1, 4096),
(410480, 15, 2, 'Topaz Shale Hatchling', 410480, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410480, 6, 0, 'Prized by gem crafters, the undamaged carapace of a topaz hatchling can be used to create stunning inlays for rings and bracelets.', -1, 4096),
(410483, 15, 2, 'Horny Toad', 410483, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410483, 6, 0, 'There are many scholars who question whether it is a toad or not.', -1, 4096),
(410484, 15, 2, 'Desert Spider', 410484, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410484, 6, 0, 'This cunning species tunnels beneath Uldum and erupts from the ground to ensnare its prey.', -1, 4096),
(410485, 15, 2, 'Stone Armadillo', 410485, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410485, 6, 0, 'When these sleepy critters aren\'t snoozing, they use their massive claws to dig for tasty insect snacks.', -1, 4096),
(410487, 15, 2, 'Alpine Chipmunk', 410487, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410487, 6, 0, 'Many an explorer has been entranced by the adorable nature of the alpine chipmunk, failing to notice its small teeth on frostbitten digits.', -1, 4096),
(410491, 15, 2, 'Sand Kitten', 410491, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410491, 6, 0, 'Originally bred by the Sandfury trolls as pets, these feral and savage felines prowl the deserts of Tanaris.', -1, 4096),
(410492, 15, 2, 'Stinkbug', 410492, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410492, 6, 0, 'A desert-dwelling insect which defends its eggs by spraying a foul, ogrelike scent.', -1, 4096),
(410493, 15, 2, 'Shimmershell Snail', 410493, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410493, 6, 0, 'Hunts for food just below the water\'s surface on the coast of Darkshore.', -1, 4096),
(410495, 15, 2, 'Frog', 410495, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410495, 6, 0, 'For every frog, a prince and princess in waiting.', -1, 4096),
(410496, 15, 2, 'Rusty Snail', 410496, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410496, 6, 0, 'Don\'t let their lack of a face fool you--these slimy critters are angry and just itching for a fight.', -1, 4096),
(410498, 15, 2, 'Tainted Moth', 410498, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410498, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell in corrupted woodlands and feed on Purple Lotus nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410499, 15, 2, 'Tainted Rat', 410499, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410499, 6, 0, 'There are some things too dirty even for rats.', -1, 4096),
(410502, 15, 2, 'Spotted Bell Frog', 410502, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410502, 6, 0, 'The dwarven explorer who first discovered the spotted bell frog could not decide between naming it after the unique spot pattern or the sound of the frog\'s mating ritual. She chose both.', -1, 4096),
(410503, 15, 2, 'Silky Moth', 410503, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410503, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell in the shadow of Nordrassil and feed on Stormvine nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410504, 15, 2, 'Diemetradon Hatchling', 410504, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410504, 6, 0, 'Diemetradons abandon their hatchlings in Un\'Goro Crater to fend for themselves. Only the strongest survive.', -1, 4096),
(410505, 15, 2, 'Twilight Iguana', 410505, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410505, 6, 0, 'Although most reptiles enjoy basking in sunlight, these scaly beasts love bathing in the glow of Azeroth\'s twin moons.', -1, 4096),
(410506, 15, 2, 'Venomspitter Hatchling', 410506, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410506, 6, 0, 'These eight-legged critters have lurked in the shadowy cliffs of the Stonetalon Mountains for millennia.', -1, 4096),
(410512, 15, 2, 'Scarab Hatchling', 410512, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410512, 6, 0, 'Spawn of the nefarious Shrieker Scarabs of Ahn\'Qiraj, the hatchlings are much more docile (and quiet) than their parents.', -1, 4096),
(410519, 15, 2, 'Fel Flame', 410519, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410519, 6, 0, 'Born from demonic magic, these petulant little entities corrupt everything they touch with foul energies.', -1, 4096),
(410523, 15, 2, 'Devouring Maggot', 410523, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410523, 6, 0, 'Howling Fjord teems with the ever shifting cycle of life. When a creature dies, its body is quickly consumed by maggots, which in turn pass those nutrients on to a number of other creatures.', -1, 4096),
(410530, 15, 2, 'Oily Slimeling', 410530, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410530, 6, 0, 'These living blobs of ooze lack even the most rudimentary form of intelligence, but that doesn\'t mean they can\'t be your friend.', -1, 4096),
(410534, 15, 2, 'Imperial Eagle Chick', 410534, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410534, 6, 0, 'The taunka collect the feathers of these noble birds of prey to use in crude fortunetelling ceremonies.', -1, 4096),
(410539, 15, 2, 'Grotto Vole', 410539, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410539, 6, 0, 'Grotto voles are often confused with mice. Never twice.', -1, 4096),
(410540, 15, 2, 'Carrion Rat', 410540, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410540, 6, 0, 'Where there is carrion, there will always be rats.', -1, 4096),
(410542, 15, 2, 'Mac Frog', 410542, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410542, 6, 0, 'Flamboyantly colored and more exuberant than most frogs.', -1, 4096),
(410544, 15, 2, 'Oasis Moth', 410544, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410544, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell along desert streams, wells or watering holes and feed on Whiptail nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410546, 15, 2, 'Tol\'vir Scarab', 410546, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410546, 6, 0, 'Carrion feeders often found in large numbers within ancient unearthed tombs; they can survive long periods of time without feeding.', -1, 4096),
(410549, 15, 2, 'Yellow-Bellied Marmot', 410549, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410549, 6, 0, 'Distinct from their plain dwelling relatives, these critters make their homes amidst the war-torn Twilight Highlands.', -1, 4096),
(410550, 15, 2, 'Highlands Mouse', 410550, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410550, 6, 0, 'The mice of the highlands, perhaps twisted by the Twilight\'s Hammer, are aggressive and fight for dominance between each other.', -1, 4096),
(410553, 15, 2, 'Stowaway Rat', 410553, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410553, 6, 0, 'In the lean times when adrift at sea, the sight of a rat was a welcome one.', -1, 4096),
(410554, 15, 2, 'Crimson Shale Hatchling', 410554, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410554, 6, 0, 'Through experimentation, the mages of Dalaran have discovered that the powered remains of a crimson shale spider will greatly increase the conflagration of their fire spells.', -1, 4096),
(410556, 15, 2, 'Crystal Beetle', 410556, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410556, 6, 0, 'A cousin to the Twilight Beetle, this insect has learned to feed on crystals which resonate with ancient energies.', -1, 4096),
(410558, 15, 2, 'Arctic Fox Kit', 410558, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410558, 6, 0, 'During frigid nights in the Storm Peaks, these critters use their fluffy tails as a blanket to stay warm.', -1, 4096),
(410559, 15, 2, 'Crimson Geode', 410559, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410559, 6, 0, 'Therazane wore these spunky crimson elementals as jewelry before the azure craze swept through Deepholm.', -1, 4096),
(410560, 15, 2, 'Sea Gull', 410560, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410560, 6, 0, 'The seagull is a coastal scavenger often found near the docks.', -1, 4096),
(410564, 15, 2, 'Emerald Turtle', 410564, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410564, 6, 0, 'It is difficult to believe that Shen-zin Su, on whose shell rests all of the Wandering Isle, began life as a tiny emerald turtle.', -1, 4096),
(410565, 15, 2, 'Jungle Darter', 410565, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410565, 6, 0, 'In the jungle, every leaf could conceal a frog. Stop to check and it could be long gone.', -1, 4096),
(410566, 15, 2, 'Mirror Strider', 410566, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410566, 6, 0, 'When preparing to travel to distant locations, Pandaren will traditionally capture a mirror strider and safely relocate it to another body of water.', -1, 4096),
(410568, 15, 2, 'Silkbead Snail', 410568, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410568, 6, 0, 'Hides in shell to escape claws of nearby crabs.', -1, 4096),
(410569, 15, 2, 'Garden Frog', 410569, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410569, 6, 0, 'One of the stranger nuisances to horticulturalists, garden frogs can cause untold damage to gardens.', -1, 4096),
(410570, 15, 2, 'Masked Tanuki', 410570, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410570, 6, 0, 'There\'s a raging debate over whether tanukis are raccoons or dogs, but the distinction seems trivial when they\'re gnawing on your femur.', -1, 4096),
(410572, 15, 2, 'Spirebound Crab', 410572, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410572, 6, 0, 'These tiny arthropods are Pandaria natives that call the area of the Windless Isle their home.', -1, 4096),
(410573, 15, 2, 'Sandy Petrel', 410573, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410573, 6, 0, 'The sandy petrel flies high above the Windless Isle, safe from landbound predators.', -1, 4096),
(410627, 15, 2, 'Infected Squirrel', 410627, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410627, 6, 0, 'More horrifying than its appearance is that the infected squirrels of the Plaguelands no longer hoard nuts, instead collecting rotten, decaying flesh.', -1, 4096);
INSERT INTO `item_template` (`entry`, `class`, `subclass`, `name`, `displayid`, `Quality`, `Flags`, `BuyPrice`, `SellPrice`, `ItemLevel`, `RequiredSkill`, `RequiredSkillRank`, `delay`, `spellid_1`, `spellcharges_1`, `spellid_2`, `spelltrigger_2`, `bonding`, `description`, `Material`, `BagFamily`) VALUES
(410629, 15, 2, 'Shore Crawler', 410629, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410629, 6, 0, 'Only found on the shores of Kezan, this lovely sea creature can be a bit snarky.', -1, 4096),
(410630, 15, 2, 'Gilnean Raven', 410630, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410630, 6, 0, 'Quoth the raven: the last word you said. It gets old.', -1, 4096),
(410632, 15, 2, 'Ash Lizard', 410632, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410632, 6, 0, 'The ash lizard gets its name from the way its shed skin looks, with an appearance like burnt cinders.', -1, 4096),
(410634, 15, 2, 'Crystal Spider', 410634, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410634, 6, 0, 'These strange critters glimmer like ice, allowing them to hide among Winterspring\'s snowy expanses.', -1, 4096),
(410637, 15, 2, 'Skittering Cavern Crawler', 410637, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410637, 6, 0, 'These arachnids use their razor-sharp legs to carve tunnels in the solid rock of the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.', -1, 4096),
(410639, 15, 2, 'Borean Marmot', 410639, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410639, 6, 0, 'Distinct from their cousins found in warmer climes, these hardy critters make their homes in the icy wastes of Northrend.', -1, 4096),
(410640, 15, 2, 'Snowshoe Hare', 410640, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410640, 6, 0, 'With the extra large surface area of their legs, snowshoe hares are able to effortlessly hop along the snow while their pursuers get bogged down in the drifts.', -1, 4096),
(410641, 15, 2, 'Arctic Hare', 410641, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410641, 6, 0, 'The heart of an arctic hare beats twice as fast as a common hare.', -1, 4096),
(410644, 15, 2, 'Fjord Rat', 410644, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410644, 6, 0, 'If not for being extremely accident prone, the fjord rat might take over the world.', -1, 4096),
(410646, 15, 2, 'Chicken', 410646, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410646, 6, 0, 'Tends to avoid crossing roads, regardless of motivations.', -1, 4096),
(410647, 15, 2, 'Grizzly Squirrel', 410647, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410647, 6, 0, 'In the deep forest, even the small creatures must have the ferocity to fend for themselves.', -1, 4096),
(410648, 15, 2, 'Huge Toad', 410648, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410648, 6, 0, 'This is a huge toad.', -1, 4096),
(410649, 15, 2, 'Biletoad', 410649, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410649, 6, 0, 'The rumors of the medicinal uses of the biletoad were believed to have been started by a particularly mischievous apothecary.', -1, 4096),
(410650, 15, 2, 'Terrible Turnip', 410650, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410650, 6, 0, 'And you thought turnips at the dinner table were bad.', -1, 4096),
(410652, 15, 2, 'Tiny Goldfish', 410652, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410652, 6, 0, 'This bubble is way worse than a tank.', -1, 4096),
(410665, 15, 2, 'Sand Scarab', 410665, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410665, 6, 0, 'Easily mistaken for a common beetle, the sting of a sand scarab will quickly clear up the misconception should you be unlucky enough to be stung by one.', -1, 4096),
(410666, 15, 2, 'Micronax', 410666, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410666, 6, 0, 'Whenever his forces would experience setbacks in Azeroth, Kil\'jaeden would pull out Micronax and terrorize the local cat-like creatures of Argus to vent his frustrations.', -1, 4096),
(410671, 15, 2, 'Lucky Quilen Cub', 410671, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410671, 6, 0, 'Offspring of the Imperial Quilen.', -1, 4096),
(410675, 15, 2, 'Stormwind Rat', 410675, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410675, 6, 0, 'Unnoticed but to cats and ratcatchers, when Deathwing descended upon Stormwind all the rats beat a hasty retreat from the city. Only of late have they returned.', -1, 4096),
(410677, 15, 2, 'Shy Bandicoon', 410677, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410677, 6, 0, 'A goblin alchemist once claimed that the bite of this raccoon gave him the gift of prophecy. Turns out, it was just rabies.', -1, 4096),
(410678, 15, 2, 'Jungle Grub', 410678, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410678, 6, 0, 'These little green grubs are native to wilds of Pandaria. Its verdant coloration camouflages it from would-be predators.', -1, 4096),
(410679, 15, 2, 'Summit Kid', 410679, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410679, 6, 0, 'You\'ll often find them perched high atop impossibly high and remote stone outcroppings. There are few creatures as sure of foot.', -1, 4096),
(410680, 15, 2, 'Kuitan Mongoose', 410680, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410680, 6, 0, 'The mongoose is prized for its ability to drive off poisonous snakes. Rikk-tikk-tikki-tikki-tchk!', -1, 4096),
(410699, 15, 2, 'Jumping Spider', 410699, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410699, 6, 0, 'This terrifying and highly venomous species leaps onto its prey from the Jade Forest\'s dense canopy.', -1, 4096),
(410702, 15, 2, 'Leopard Tree Frog', 410702, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410702, 6, 0, 'The leopard tree frog was named for the way it pounces from branch to branch.', -1, 4096),
(410703, 15, 2, 'Masked Tanuki Pup', 410703, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410703, 6, 0, 'Many young raccoons rail against their strict curfews, complaining that dawn is way too early to go to bed.', -1, 4096),
(410706, 15, 2, 'Bandicoon', 410706, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410706, 6, 0, 'The taciturn bandicoon\'s diet consists mostly of apples.', -1, 4096),
(410707, 15, 2, 'Bandicoon Kit', 410707, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410707, 6, 0, 'Some druids say pandaren and raccoons are distant cousins, but never when a pandaren can hear them.', -1, 4096),
(410708, 15, 2, 'Malayan Quillrat', 410708, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410708, 6, 0, 'Many believe that the quillrat is able to shoot its spines at aggressors.', -1, 4096),
(410709, 15, 2, 'Malayan Quillrat Pup', 410709, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410709, 6, 0, 'Although the wounds caused by the young quillrat are seldom fatal, most predators seek easier prey.', -1, 4096),
(410710, 15, 2, 'Marsh Fiddler', 410710, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410710, 6, 0, 'Known to feast on the tasty plants in Valley of the Four Winds.', -1, 4096),
(410711, 15, 2, 'Sifang Otter', 410711, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410711, 6, 0, 'The sifang otter lives near rivers and is normally friendly and playful.', -1, 4096),
(410712, 15, 2, 'Sifang Otter Pup', 410712, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410712, 6, 0, 'Otters swim by propelling themselves with their powerful tails and flexing their long bodies. Very fast in the water.', -1, 4096),
(410713, 15, 2, 'Softshell Snapling', 410713, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410713, 6, 0, 'Softshell turtle meat is considered a delicacy and is the key ingredient in soothing turtle bisque.', -1, 4096),
(410714, 15, 2, 'Feverbite Hatchling', 410714, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410714, 6, 0, 'The common folk remedy to a feverbite hatchling\'s bite is to dance wildly and try to sweat out the toxins before they can take hold.', -1, 4096),
(410716, 15, 2, 'Amethyst Spiderling', 410716, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410716, 6, 0, 'A rarity among arachnids, these non-venomous critters feed solely on plants and fruit.', -1, 4096),
(410717, 15, 2, 'Savory Beetle', 410717, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410717, 6, 0, 'The most delicious of the beetle family.', -1, 4096),
(410718, 15, 2, 'Luyu Moth', 410718, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410718, 6, 0, 'A daring, narcissist insect willing to brave any threat in its pursuit of the spotlight.', -1, 4096),
(410723, 15, 2, 'Spiny Terrapin', 410723, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410723, 6, 0, 'Angering a spiny terrapin will cause it to withdraw into its shell and begin to spin wildly towards an attacker.', -1, 4096),
(410724, 15, 2, 'Alpine Foxling', 410724, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410724, 6, 0, 'Burrows deep into snowbanks to hide from predators.', -1, 4096),
(410725, 15, 2, 'Alpine Foxling Kit', 410725, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410725, 6, 0, 'Occasionally sneaks bites of food from kills made by much larger animals.', -1, 4096),
(410726, 15, 2, 'Plains Monitor', 410726, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410726, 6, 0, 'While stationary, the plains monitor will continuously flick its tail back and forth. From a distance this mimics the appearance of swaying tallgrass, camouflaging the lizard from aerial predators.', -1, 4096),
(410727, 15, 2, 'Prairie Mouse', 410727, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410727, 6, 0, 'On the prairie there are numerous rodents and other small creatures, but none more common than the mouse.', -1, 4096),
(410728, 15, 2, 'Szechuan Chicken', 410728, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410728, 6, 0, 'Will only lay eggs in bright light.', -1, 4096),
(410729, 15, 2, 'Tolai Hare', 410729, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410729, 6, 0, 'In the ancient fables, the first Tolai hare strode across the gulf between the stars before it upset them and they tumbled from the heavens to the world below.', -1, 4096),
(410730, 15, 2, 'Tolai Hare Pup', 410730, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410730, 6, 0, 'Tolai hare pups are sent from their dens at a young age to find their own way.', -1, 4096),
(410732, 15, 2, 'Amber Moth', 410732, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410732, 6, 0, 'Known to flourish in the rainy season, this insect is drawn to lightning storms.', -1, 4096),
(410733, 15, 2, 'Grassland Hopper', 410733, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410733, 6, 0, 'At night, the grassland hoppers fill the night with their maddening song. Those unaccustomed to it have spent many a sleepless night serenaded by their mating calls.', -1, 4096),
(410737, 15, 2, 'Mongoose', 410737, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410737, 6, 0, 'Contrary to its benign appearance, mongoose are dangerous carnivores, well known for their ability to hunt venomous snakes that could kill much larger creatures.', -1, 4096),
(410739, 15, 2, 'Mongoose Pup', 410739, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410739, 6, 0, 'Mongoose pups prefer long grass where only their mothers can find them.', -1, 4096),
(410740, 15, 2, 'Yakrat', 410740, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410740, 6, 0, 'The bond between yak and rat is a strange one, and what the rat gains out of the symbiotic relationship is a mystery.', -1, 4096),
(410741, 15, 2, 'Silent Hedgehog', 410741, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410741, 6, 0, 'These hedgehogs may be silent, but often are heard the cries of those that foolishly step upon their quills.', -1, 4096),
(410742, 15, 2, 'Clouded Hedgehog', 410742, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410742, 6, 0, 'Hedgehogs are not at all fond of croquet nor flamingos.', -1, 4096),
(410743, 15, 2, 'Rapana Whelk', 410743, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410743, 6, 0, 'Has been spotted fighting other whelks for prime food sources.', -1, 4096),
(410746, 15, 2, 'Emperor Crab', 410746, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410746, 6, 0, 'The emperor crab was named for its regal appearance: the ridges of its shell and its raised claws eerily resembling a crown. One that would pinch your eyes out if you tried to wear it.', -1, 4096),
(410748, 15, 2, 'Gilded Moth', 410748, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410748, 6, 0, 'This delicate insect\'s wings are often sewn into clothing and armor.', -1, 4096),
(410749, 15, 2, 'Golden Civet', 410749, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410749, 6, 0, 'Civets are landbound cousins of the otter and are prized for their heady musks.', -1, 4096),
(410750, 15, 2, 'Golden Civet Kitten', 410750, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410750, 6, 0, 'The civets are known to guard their young ferociously.', -1, 4096),
(410751, 15, 2, 'Dancing Water Skimmer', 410751, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410751, 6, 0, 'Named for their apparent dancelike behavior when skimming aquatic surfaces, the species uses erratic movements to avoid being devoured by fish and other underwater predators.', -1, 4096),
(410752, 15, 2, 'Yellow-Bellied Bullfrog', 410752, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410752, 6, 0, 'Despite its menacing appearance, the yellow-bellied bullfrog was aptly named.', -1, 4096),
(410753, 15, 2, 'Garden Moth', 410753, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410753, 6, 0, 'Known to flourish in the rainy season, this insect is drawn to lightning storms.', -1, 4096),
(410756, 15, 2, 'Fungal Moth', 410756, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410756, 6, 0, 'Prefers to dwell in dark caves and feed on Heartblossom nectar.', -1, 4096),
(410792, 15, 2, 'Jade Crane Chick', 410792, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410792, 6, 0, 'A graceful creature from the isle of Pandaria.', -1, 4096),
(410802, 15, 2, 'Thundering Serpent Hatchling', 410802, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410802, 6, 0, 'A baby version of the mighty Thundering Cloud Serpent that hails from the far lands of Pandaria.', -1, 4096),
(410817, 15, 2, 'Wild Jade Hatchling', 410817, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410817, 6, 0, 'So cute, yet so epic.', -1, 4096),
(410818, 15, 2, 'Wild Golden Hatchling', 410818, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410818, 6, 0, 'The offspring of Tsulong, hidden away before the corruption of the Sha had fully taken hold of the Terrace of Endless Spring.', -1, 4096),
(410819, 15, 2, 'Wild Crimson Hatchling', 410819, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410819, 6, 0, 'It\'s red, so it must fly faster.', -1, 4096),
(410820, 15, 2, 'Singing Cricket', 410820, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410820, 6, 0, 'Known to feast on the tasty plants in Krasarang Wilds.', -1, 4096),
(410821, 15, 2, 'Feral Vermling', 410821, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410821, 6, 0, 'It keeps looking at me. I think it wants to bite me.', -1, 4096),
(410835, 15, 2, 'Hopling', 410835, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410835, 6, 0, 'The great big world can be a dangerous place for such a tiny, adorable creature.', -1, 4096),
(410836, 15, 2, 'Aqua Strider', 410836, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410836, 6, 0, 'Water striders serve an important role in Jinyu culture, acting as a mount, means of sending communications, and even a family pet.', -1, 4096),
(410837, 15, 2, 'Emerald Shale Hatchling', 410837, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410837, 6, 0, 'Adventurers have reported rare sightings of a monstrous sized emerald shale spider, which the denizens of Deepholm have come to call the Jadefang.', -1, 4096),
(410838, 15, 2, 'Amethyst Shale Hatchling', 410838, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410838, 6, 0, 'Adult amethyst shale spiders prefer to create their nests against the outer walls of Deepholm.', -1, 4096),
(410844, 15, 2, 'Mechanical Pandaren Dragonling', 410844, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410844, 6, 0, 'Constructed from a seemingly impossible mass of gears, springs, wires, and a little something special, this dragonling embodies the spirit of Pandaria as seen through an engineer\'s goggles.', -1, 4096),
(410847, 15, 2, 'Fishy', 410847, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410847, 6, 0, 'Many believe (incorrectly) that goldfish have no memories. Trainers who have worked with them know this is clearly not the case and have the bruises to prove it.', -1, 4096),
(410848, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Rabbit', 410848, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410848, 6, 0, 'This rabbit is much stronger than it looks.', -1, 4096),
(410849, 15, 2, 'Chi-Ji Kite', 410849, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410849, 6, 0, 'A beautiful kite brought to life by the scribes of Pandaria.', -1, 4096),
(410850, 15, 2, 'Yu\'lon Kite', 410850, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410850, 6, 0, 'Who knew scribes could make kites?', -1, 4096),
(410851, 15, 2, 'Horned Lizard', 410851, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410851, 6, 0, 'Not only is it quick, it\'s loud too!', -1, 4096),
(410855, 15, 2, 'Venus', 410855, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410855, 6, 0, 'Seems odd that he doesn\'t like flies... right?', -1, 4096),
(410868, 15, 2, 'Pandaren Water Spirit', 410868, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410868, 6, 0, 'Water spirits are especially mischievous, and are known to frequent the canals of the Stormstout Brewery.', -1, 4096),
(410903, 15, 2, 'Baneling', 410903, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 410903, 6, 0, 'A rolling, explosive member of the Zerg swarm, the baneling deals terrible, terrible damage. Very dangerous in close quarters.', -1, 4096),
(411013, 15, 2, 'Wanderer\'s Festival Hatchling', 411013, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411013, 6, 0, 'Legend has it that a seadragon turtle just like this one grew up to become Shen-zin Su, the Wandering Isle. Perhaps your little turtle will grow into something amazing?', -1, 4096),
(411040, 15, 2, 'Imperial Silkworm', 411040, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411040, 6, 0, 'This plump red caterpillar is world-renowned for creating the finest silk in Azeroth.', -1, 4096),
(411042, 15, 2, 'Red Cricket', 411042, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411042, 6, 0, 'Be careful, he might eat all your crops!', -1, 4096),
(411061, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Hatchling', 411061, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411061, 6, 0, 'Most of Violet\'s numerous forest strider hatchlings are turned into Faire fare by Stamp Thunderhorn, though a few are raised as mounts or purchased by adventurers looking for a petite purple pet.', -1, 4096),
(411063, 15, 2, 'Darkmoon Eye', 411063, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411063, 6, 0, 'Don\'t even think about cheating now.', -1, 4096),
(411068, 15, 2, 'Crow', 411068, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411068, 6, 0, 'While smaller than the infamous ravens of Gilneas, crows are no less clever or cunning.', -1, 4096),
(411117, 15, 2, 'Cinder Kitten', 411117, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411117, 6, 0, 'A playful, purring pyromaniac. Don\'t pet these kittens without fireproof mittens!', -1, 4096),
(411124, 15, 2, 'Pandaren Fire Spirit', 411124, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411124, 6, 0, 'Though it appears to be a vaguely-related cousin to the Cinder Kitten, the two creatures actually share no ancestry.', -1, 4096),
(411125, 15, 2, 'Pandaren Air Spirit', 411125, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411125, 6, 0, 'These spirits represent the heart of Pandaria\'s elemental powers.', -1, 4096),
(411126, 15, 2, 'Pandaren Earth Spirit', 411126, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411126, 6, 0, 'The elements of Pandaria can be cute and playful, until their homeland is threatened.', -1, 4096),
(411128, 15, 2, 'Sumprush Rodent', 411128, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411128, 6, 0, 'A rodent of usual size.', -1, 4096),
(411143, 15, 2, 'Giant Bone Spider', 411143, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411143, 6, 0, 'Found in a dusty egg clutch at the back of Maexxna\'s lair, these creatures are already undead when they hatch.', -1, 4096),
(411145, 15, 2, 'Mr. Bigglesworth', 411145, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411145, 6, 0, 'Upon exiting the freezing necropolis of Naxxramas, Mr. Bigglesworth promptly found a warm spot in the sun to take a long nap in.', -1, 4096),
(411149, 15, 2, 'Corefire Imp', 411149, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411149, 6, 0, 'These tiny flame imps roam the Molten Core in large swarms and can replenish their numbers rapidly.', -1, 4096),
(411150, 15, 2, 'Ashstone Core', 411150, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411150, 6, 0, 'The cooled core of Golemagg, it appears to retain some semi-sentient properties.', -1, 4096),
(411159, 15, 2, 'Lofty Libram', 411159, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411159, 6, 0, 'Most people have never read this book.', -1, 4096),
(411160, 15, 2, 'Arcane Eye', 411160, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411160, 6, 0, 'Never take your eye off of it.', -1, 4096),
(411162, 15, 2, 'Fluxfire Feline', 411162, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411162, 6, 0, 'Originally created by the engineers in the bowels of Gnomeregan, the Fluxfire Feline is a marvel of modern engineering.', -1, 4096),
(411163, 15, 2, 'Anodized Robo Cub', 411163, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411163, 6, 0, 'The engineering wizards in Everlook created this unique cub as a test model. Unfortunately a few went rogue and were never recovered.', -1, 4096),
(411164, 15, 2, 'Cogblade Raptor', 411164, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411164, 6, 0, 'This model of raptors is produced in the Blade\'s Edge Mountains. Their robotic roars are a common sound near Toshley Station.', -1, 4096),
(411166, 15, 2, 'Kun-Lai Runt', 411166, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411166, 6, 0, 'Indigenous to the peaks of Kun-Lai Summit, this rare yeti is much more dangerous than it looks.', -1, 4096),
(411174, 15, 2, 'Gusting Grimoire', 411174, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411174, 6, 0, 'A fel-tainted tome whose secrets are so terrible and bizarre that its pages have taken on an eerie semblance of life. Found on many a warlock\'s nightstand.', -1, 4096),
(411175, 15, 2, 'Thundertail Flapper', 411175, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411175, 6, 0, 'Touched by lightning, these dangerous rodents should be kept at a safe distance.', -1, 4096),
(411177, 15, 2, 'Living Sandling', 411177, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411177, 6, 0, 'Born of sand, these dangerous creatures can form and disperse in the blink of an eye.', -1, 4096),
(411179, 15, 2, 'Electrified Razortooth', 411179, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411179, 6, 0, 'Lightning can be seen flowing across its body, teeth to tail.', -1, 4096),
(411180, 15, 2, 'Zandalari Kneebiter', 411180, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411180, 6, 0, 'This unique raptor was born on the island of Zandalar and transported here along with the rest of the Zandalari army.', -1, 4096),
(411181, 15, 2, 'Elder Python', 411181, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411181, 6, 0, 'These snakes have been known to swallow gnomes in one gulp.', -1, 4096),
(411182, 15, 2, 'Swamp Croaker', 411182, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411182, 6, 0, 'Probably best not to touch it.', -1, 4096),
(411183, 15, 2, 'Son of Animus', 411183, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411183, 6, 0, 'Forged in the Throne of Thunder, these tiny creations are servants of the great Dark Animus.', -1, 4096),
(411184, 15, 2, 'Stunted Direhorn', 411184, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411184, 6, 0, 'Even at this tiny size, Direhorns are known to wreak havoc on unsuspecting victims.', -1, 4096),
(411185, 15, 2, 'Spectral Porcupette', 411185, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411185, 6, 0, 'Something about this creature looks familiar...', -1, 4096),
(411200, 15, 2, 'Pygmy Direhorn', 411200, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411200, 6, 0, 'Don\'t pet the pointy end. Note: all of the ends are pointy.', -1, 4096),
(411201, 15, 2, 'Spawn of G\'nathus', 411201, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411201, 6, 0, 'Some Pandaren believe G\'nathus to be an ancient Zandalari Loa left behind to guard the waters south of Lei Shen\'s island citadel.', -1, 4096),
(411202, 15, 2, 'Ji-Kun Hatchling', 411202, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411202, 6, 0, 'Deadly offspring of the Ancient Mother, Ji-Kun Hatchlings are considered sacred treasures in many cultures.', -1, 4096),
(411204, 15, 2, 'Pierre', 411204, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411204, 6, 0, 'Every cook\'s dream wrapped up in a perfect bundle of metal and bolts. Too bad what he cooks up isn\'t suitable for humanoid consumption. According to Jard\'s notes, he intends to make this little guy for his friend, Emily Cole.', -1, 4096),
(411205, 15, 2, 'Direhorn Runt', 411205, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411205, 6, 0, 'The Zandalari breed specific Direhorn species for their small size for use as mounts.', -1, 4096),
(411206, 15, 2, 'Tiny Red Carp', 411206, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411206, 6, 0, 'The red scales on these fish are believed to be a warning to predators of the Townlong Steppes and the Dread Wastes that their flesh is toxic. Dedicated fishermen can sometimes befriend one.', -1, 4096),
(411207, 15, 2, 'Tiny Blue Carp', 411207, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411207, 6, 0, 'These little guys can be found in the waters of the Timeless Isle, or swimming alongside Jewel Danio or Redbelly Mandarin. Dedicated fishermen can sometimes befriend one.', -1, 4096),
(411208, 15, 2, 'Tiny Green Carp', 411208, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411208, 6, 0, 'It is believed that the green coloration and stripes on the tiny green carp serve as camouflage in the waters of the Jade Forest, Valley of the Four Winds and the Krasarang Wilds. Dedicated fishermen can sometimes befriend one.', -1, 4096),
(411209, 15, 2, 'Tiny White Carp', 411209, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411209, 6, 0, 'These hardy fish can survive in a wide range of climates, from the snow capped mountains of Kun-Lai Summit to the temperate, salty waters of the oceans around Pandaria. Dedicated fishermen can sometimes befriend one.', -1, 4096),
(411211, 15, 2, 'Zandalari Anklerender', 411211, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411211, 6, 0, 'These tiny minions of Zandalar are adept at stowing away within the cargo holds of the enormous Zandalari warships.', -1, 4096),
(411212, 15, 2, 'Zandalari Footslasher', 411212, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411212, 6, 0, 'Even at this size, these raptors can eviscerate an entire cow in less than 10 seconds.', -1, 4096),
(411213, 15, 2, 'Zandalari Toenibbler', 411213, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411213, 6, 0, 'These adorable beasts are both cuddly and huggable, provided you do not enjoy having a face.', -1, 4096),
(411229, 15, 2, 'Fiendish Imp', 411229, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411229, 6, 0, 'A minion of Terestian Illhoof, this tricky imp was left in Karazhan when the portal to the Twisting Nether closed behind it.', -1, 4096),
(411233, 15, 2, 'Pocket Reaver', 411233, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411233, 6, 0, 'Sent through the Twisting Nether by the great Archimonde the Defiler to terrorize tiny civilizations with their medium-sized stomping noises.', -1, 4096),
(411238, 15, 2, 'Unborn Val\'kyr', 411238, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411238, 6, 0, 'Val\'kyr are considered "unborn" until they vanquish a creature of high nobility.', -1, 4096),
(411243, 15, 2, 'Living Fluid', 411243, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411243, 6, 0, 'The dark pools in Primordius\' chamber laid stagnant after the fall of the mogu, and murky thoughts began to coalesce.', -1, 4096),
(411244, 15, 2, 'Viscous Horror', 411244, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411244, 6, 0, 'These malicious oozes are highly sensitive to Primordius\' pheromone signature.', -1, 4096),
(411245, 15, 2, 'Filthling', 411245, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411245, 6, 0, 'Battle pet trainers are strongly encouraged to wash their hands for at least 30 minutes after playing with the filthling.', -1, 4096),
(411248, 15, 2, 'Blossoming Ancient', 411248, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411248, 6, 0, 'This budding ancient is a unique variety in Azeroth, created from the ever-living branches of the Great Tree, and can bloom in any season.', -1, 4096),
(411255, 15, 2, 'Zeradar', 411255, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411255, 6, 0, 'Infamous psionic battering ram of the Protoss, Zeradar is also the only archon that can utilize psionic storm. Power overwhelming!', -1, 4096),
(411256, 15, 2, 'Rascal-Bot', 411256, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411256, 6, 0, 'This little guy seems to like to hang out at the fringes of cataclysmic events. There is no evidence to suggest he has anything to do with the cause of these events, though - he\'s probably just an observer.', -1, 4096),
(411266, 15, 2, 'Xu-Fu, Cub of Xuen', 411266, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411266, 6, 0, 'Fierce and loyal, Xu-Fu loves to hunt by moonlight. Once during a full moon, he killed and ate an entire Ironfur Great Bull, prompting a two day nap.', -1, 4096),
(411303, 15, 2, 'Chi-Chi, Hatchling of Chi-Ji', 411303, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411303, 6, 0, 'Chi-Chi tries to inspire hope with her loud squawk and by chasing, and eventually eating, butterflies.', -1, 4096),
(411304, 15, 2, 'Yu\'la, Broodling of Yu\'lon', 411304, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411304, 6, 0, 'A master sculptor devoted her life to creating an incomparably beautiful statue, inspired by her love and reverence for Yu\'lon. When the sculptor passed away, Yu\'lon breathed a fraction of her essence into the statue, bringing Yu\'la into the world.', -1, 4096),
(411305, 15, 2, 'Zao, Calfling of Niuzao', 411305, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411305, 6, 0, 'Always on the lookout for a fight or some tasty grass, Zao keeps his head down and eyes forward.', -1, 4096),
(411320, 15, 2, 'Lil\' Bling', 411320, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411320, 6, 0, 'This handsome little robot is the spitting image of his "Dad", Blingtron 4000. As a Blingtron\'s generosity circuits don\'t mature until they have been built to maximum specification, you shouldn\'t expect any free handouts from him.', -1, 4096),
(411321, 15, 2, 'Azure Crane Chick', 411321, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411321, 6, 0, 'Crane chicks of the Timeless Isle sometimes sing a curious song that calms the nerves and soothes the soul.', -1, 4096),
(411323, 15, 2, 'Ashleaf Spriteling', 411323, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411323, 6, 0, 'The Ashleaf Sprites of the Timeless Isle tirelessly protect the vegetation of the island from the burning fury of Ordos and his minions.', -1, 4096),
(411328, 15, 2, 'Ruby Droplet', 411328, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411328, 6, 0, 'The waters of Ruby Lake are colored a strange reddish hue, possibly due to the ruby crystals found deep within the mountains of the Timeless Isle.', -1, 4096),
(411329, 15, 2, 'Dandelion Frolicker', 411329, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411329, 6, 0, 'While fascinated by flowers, the frolicker has also been known to dance with blades of grass and the occasional weed.', -1, 4096),
(411330, 15, 2, 'Death Adder Hatchling', 411330, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411330, 6, 0, 'Late in life, if the environmental conditions are correct, a Death Adder may shed its skin and undergo a transformation into an Imperial Python.', -1, 4096),
(411331, 15, 2, 'Droplet of Y\'Shaarj', 411331, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411331, 6, 0, 'A small remnant of the power of Y\'shaarj that spawned the Sha, a single Drop of Y\'shaarj can magnify emotional states for thousands of yards, causing entire towns to shut down in fear or doubt.', -1, 4096),
(411332, 15, 2, 'Gooey Sha-ling', 411332, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411332, 6, 0, 'Sha-lings reflect the emotional state of their handler, becoming agitated, depressed, fearful, or doubtful depending on the magnitude of negative thoughts around them.', -1, 4096),
(411333, 15, 2, 'Jademist Dancer', 411333, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411333, 6, 0, 'The Jademist Dancers of the Timeless Isle have a curious attraction to the steam vents of the northwestern shore.', -1, 4096),
(411334, 15, 2, 'Kovok', 411334, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411334, 6, 0, 'The tiny terror of the Dread Wastes, Kovok prefers a steady diet of "brain food:" mushan brains, human brains, any brains really. This strange nutritional requirement may be tangentally related to his enormous head.', -1, 4096),
(411335, 15, 2, 'Ominous Flame', 411335, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411335, 6, 0, 'The odd blue flames found within the Cavern of Lost Spirits have led many unwary adventurers to their doom.', -1, 4096),
(411336, 15, 2, 'Skunky Alemental', 411336, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411336, 6, 0, 'When the village of Pi\'jiu was attacked by the Ordon Yaungol generations ago, the villagers bravely erected a keg in the center of the village.', -1, 4096),
(411337, 15, 2, 'Spineclaw Crab', 411337, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411337, 6, 0, 'Spineclaw crabs of Pandaria have existed for thousands of years and remain one of the continent\'s oldest creatures.', -1, 4096),
(411338, 15, 2, 'Gulp Froglet', 411338, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411338, 6, 0, 'Gulp frogs of the Timeless Isle can feast upon prey several times larger than themselves by slowly digesting the victim externally with a toxic slime.', -1, 4096),
(411343, 15, 2, 'Bonkers', 411343, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411343, 6, 0, 'Some young and rambunctious hozen are trained from an early age to use boxing gloves so they don\'t accidentally kill their tribe members, and more importantly, to keep them from picking their noses.', -1, 4096),
(411344, 15, 2, 'Vengeful Porcupette', 411344, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411344, 6, 0, 'One of the beasts left on the Timeless Isle when it shifted through time, most likely sacrificed by the Ordon to their demigod, Ordos.', -1, 4096),
(411345, 15, 2, 'Gu\'chi Swarmling', 411345, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411345, 6, 0, 'Swarmlings of Gu\'chi spin an ancient, and very powerful, form of silk that has not been seen in Pandaria in ages.', -1, 4096),
(411346, 15, 2, 'Harmonious Porcupette', 411346, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411346, 6, 0, 'Prolonged exposure to Shaohao\'s tranquil mists has calmed these spirits, which act as peaceful companions to the Mistweavers.', -1, 4096),
(411348, 15, 2, 'Jadefire Spirit', 411348, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411348, 6, 0, 'The Jadefire Spirit is thought to be a living embodiment of Yu\'lon\'s own jade breath.', -1, 4096),
(411350, 15, 2, 'Sky Lantern', 411350, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411350, 6, 0, 'A candle inside of the kite heats the air, causing it to rise into the air without the need for wind.', -1, 4096),
(411363, 15, 2, 'Alterac Brew-Pup', 411363, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411363, 6, 0, 'A mastiff bred for rescue, the Alterac brewhound\'s bloodline is famous for having found and resuscitated many mountain travelers trapped beneath the snow... and then slobbering all over them.', -1, 4096),
(411364, 15, 2, 'Murkalot', 411364, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411364, 6, 0, 'We\'re Crusaders from a fable. We dance whene\'er we\'re able. We do routines and chorus scenes, with footwork impeccable!', -1, 4096),
(411365, 15, 2, 'Treasure Goblin', 411365, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411365, 6, 0, 'Watch your coin purse.', -1, 4096),
(411386, 15, 2, 'Dread Hatchling', 411386, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411386, 6, 0, 'The dark wings will cloud and consume the minds of the weak, because they are just so adorable!', -1, 4096),
(411387, 15, 2, 'Iron Starlette', 411387, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411387, 6, 0, 'This massive weapon of destruction has been miniaturized for use in the garden. Moles beware!', -1, 4096),
(411394, 15, 2, 'Weebomination', 411394, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411394, 6, 0, 'Made from bits and pieces of vanquished battle pets, dark magic, and just a pinch of love.', -1, 4096),
(411396, 15, 2, 'Crazy Carrot', 411396, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411396, 6, 0, 'Left to their own devices, carrots will simply lose their minds.', -1, 4096),
(411403, 15, 2, 'Mechanical Axebeak', 411403, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411403, 6, 0, 'Squeeeeeeeawk!', -1, 4096),
(411411, 15, 2, 'Royal Peachick', 411411, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411411, 6, 0, 'A single peacock feather is often laid upon a grave to ward off evil spirits.', -1, 4096),
(411412, 15, 2, 'Lifelike Mechanical Frostboar', 411412, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411412, 6, 0, 'After many complaints that taming young boars was a painful experience, engineers came to the rescue with this creepily lifelike model.', -1, 4096),
(411416, 15, 2, 'Teroclaw Hatchling', 411416, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411416, 6, 0, 'The teroclaw is a potent hunter of the small and furry.', -1, 4096),
(411426, 15, 2, 'Elekk Plushie', 411426, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411426, 6, 0, 'This adorable little elephant is always there for you.', -1, 4096),
(411427, 15, 2, 'Frostfur Rat', 411427, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411427, 6, 0, 'Annoying and destructive, they can be coaxed with enough cheese to become a tolerable companion.', -1, 4096),
(411429, 15, 2, 'Autumnal Sproutling', 411429, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411429, 6, 0, 'From seed to flower, a tiny terror is grown.', -1, 4096),
(411430, 15, 2, 'Forest Sproutling', 411430, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411430, 6, 0, 'From seed to flower, a tiny terror is grown.', -1, 4096),
(411432, 15, 2, 'Nightshade Sproutling', 411432, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411432, 6, 0, 'From seed to flower, a tiny terror is grown.', -1, 4096),
(411434, 15, 2, 'Sun Sproutling', 411434, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411434, 6, 0, 'From seed to flower, a tiny terror is grown.', -1, 4096),
(411441, 15, 2, 'Mud Jumper', 411441, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411441, 6, 0, 'Orcish children have a tradition where they sneak up on a mud jumper and whisper a secret they wish to come true. If the mud jumper doesn\'t jump, the wish will come true.', -1, 4096),
(411442, 15, 2, 'Ghastly Kid', 411442, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411442, 6, 0, 'In the ultimate demonstration of stubborness, this once-living nannie simply refused to die.', -1, 4096),
(411447, 15, 2, 'Moonshell Crab', 411447, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411447, 6, 0, 'The moonshell crab reflects light so well that they can be picked up and used as a mirror. Just keep your face away from the claws!', -1, 4096),
(411449, 15, 2, 'Deathwatch Hatchling', 411449, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411449, 6, 0, 'This hatchling has an unusual sense that allows it to detect and follow along with alpha predators.', -1, 4096),
(411450, 15, 2, 'Draenei Micro Defender', 411450, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411450, 6, 0, 'While these tiny mechanical guardians were created to protect domesticated elekks from pests, they also turned out to be really good at giving back massages.', -1, 4096),
(411451, 15, 2, 'Molten Corgi', 411451, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411451, 6, 0, 'Loves to herd imps, roll around in lava, and snuggle with elemental lords.', -1, 4096),
(411453, 15, 2, 'River Calf', 411453, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411453, 6, 0, 'Surprisingly quick when provoked, but easily calmed with a meal of Nagrand arrowbloom.', -1, 4096),
(411454, 15, 2, 'Murkidan', 411454, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411454, 6, 0, 'After consuming the shin bone of Gul\'dan, this fiesty demon hunter was caged for 10000 years by his brother Murkfurion.', -1, 4096),
(411455, 15, 2, 'Mossbite Skitterer', 411455, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411455, 6, 0, 'Camouflaged like moss, the skitterer will hide in trees and leap on their victims from above.', -1, 4096),
(411456, 15, 2, 'Thicket Skitterer', 411456, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411456, 6, 0, 'Their deceptively cute looks will lure in their prey, and then greet them with a flurry of devastating swipes. Hug with caution.', -1, 4096),
(411457, 15, 2, 'Icespine Hatchling', 411457, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411457, 6, 0, 'Equipped with extremely sharp claws, these frigid hatchlings dig through thick layers of ice and rock for shelter.', -1, 4096),
(411458, 15, 2, 'Bone Wasp', 411458, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411458, 6, 0, 'One ogre ritual involves cupping a bone wasp in their hands and shaking vigorously. The venom increases strength and invokes vivid imagery.', -1, 4096),
(411462, 15, 2, 'Bloodsting Wasp', 411462, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411462, 6, 0, 'Contrary to popular belief, bloodsting wasps do not feed on blood, but love.', -1, 4096),
(411463, 15, 2, 'Wood Wasp', 411463, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411463, 6, 0, 'Wood wasps make nests in dead or hollowed out trees, and are quick to attack anything that threatens their home.', -1, 4096),
(411464, 15, 2, 'Twilight Wasp', 411464, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411464, 6, 0, 'In the moonlight their wings create a glittering aura, giving the illusion of twinkling starlight.', -1, 4096),
(411465, 15, 2, 'Amberbarb Wasp', 411465, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411465, 6, 0, 'Amberbarbs often try to provoke larger creatures to attack it. Once their victim strikes them, they will retaliate with the entire hive.', -1, 4096),
(411466, 15, 2, 'Brightpaw', 411466, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411466, 6, 0, 'This magical kitty has so much energy that she will sometimes zip around for no reason whatsoever.', -1, 4096),
(411467, 15, 2, 'Sky-Bo', 411467, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411467, 6, 0, 'The Sky-Bo was originally designed by the infamous Millie Watt as a toy for her cat. The cat just slept in the box next to it.', -1, 4096),
(411468, 15, 2, 'Bloodbeak', 411468, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411468, 6, 0, 'The ancient tribes of Draenor were known to harvest their sharp beaks for crude tools and weapons.', -1, 4096),
(411469, 15, 2, 'Junglebeak', 411469, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411469, 6, 0, 'The colorful plumage from these birds are highly sought after by collectors. It is rumored that wearing these feathers will bring you good luck.', -1, 4096),
(411470, 15, 2, 'Axebeak Hatchling', 411470, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411470, 6, 0, 'The edges of its beak are particularly sharp. Watch your fingers during feeding time!', -1, 4096),
(411471, 15, 2, 'Fruit Hunter', 411471, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411471, 6, 0, 'This anxious avian has a voracious appetite for fruit.', -1, 4096),
(411478, 15, 2, 'Syd the Squid', 411478, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411478, 6, 0, 'This tiny squid seems to enjoy wearing pants, but where in the world would you find some that fit?', -1, 4096),
(411495, 15, 2, 'Ore Eater', 411495, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411495, 6, 0, 'They eat and eat and eat, until they grow large. Then they eat some more.', -1, 4096),
(411511, 15, 2, 'Lovebird Hatchling', 411511, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411511, 6, 0, 'Of course there are hatchlings, they\'re called Lovebirds aren\'t they?', -1, 4096),
(411515, 15, 2, 'Stonegrinder', 411515, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411515, 6, 0, 'The master-crafted gear assembly and precision joints in this robot are clearly made with love.', -1, 4096),
(411516, 15, 2, 'Bush Chicken', 411516, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411516, 6, 0, 'Following their introduction to the mainland by the goblins, Bush Chickens have become the entre du jour for Pilgrim\'s Bounty due to their high deliciousness and low intelligence.', -1, 4096),
(411517, 15, 2, 'Blazing Cindercrawler', 411517, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411517, 6, 0, 'Tiny, incinerated corpses of various insects line its cage.', -1, 4096),
(411518, 15, 2, 'Stout Alemental', 411518, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411518, 6, 0, 'The Pandaren Brewmasters accidentally brought a barrel of Uncle Gao\'s last sentient batch of brew with them to Brewfest.', -1, 4096),
(411530, 15, 2, 'Frostwolf Ghostpup', 411530, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411530, 6, 0, 'The little wolf told to stay. Watching, waiting, for vacant prey. Too proud to leave, she slipped away. Unburdened now, forever free to play.', -1, 4096),
(411531, 15, 2, 'Ancient Nest Guardian', 411531, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411531, 6, 0, 'The ancient nest guardian was designed with the unthinkable in mind: to hate cats.', -1, 4096),
(411533, 15, 2, 'Lanticore Spawnling', 411533, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411533, 6, 0, 'No one knows what deep part of Blackwing Descent the Lanticore was kept in, but it probably smelled pretty awful.', -1, 4096),
(411541, 15, 2, 'Hydraling', 411541, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411541, 6, 0, 'The hydraling can be an expensive pet, as it is capable of eating from three food bowls at the same time.', -1, 4096),
(411542, 15, 2, 'Frostwolf Pup', 411542, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411542, 6, 0, 'These pups are bundles of fur and teeth until they grow up, at which point they are really just teeth.', -1, 4096),
(411545, 15, 2, 'Firewing', 411545, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411545, 6, 0, 'Don\'t line her cage with paper unless you want a fire.', -1, 4096),
(411546, 15, 2, 'Stormwing', 411546, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411546, 6, 0, 'Half bird, half elemental, the beautiful Stormwing is truly capable of shock and awe.', -1, 4096),
(411564, 15, 2, 'Doom Bloom', 411564, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411564, 6, 0, 'A clear indication why goblin fertilizers should be used sparingly.', -1, 4096),
(411566, 15, 2, 'Everbloom Peachick', 411566, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411566, 6, 0, 'These tiny creatures seem to favor big, fluffy nests, preferably atop an animal-loving dryad.', -1, 4096),
(411567, 15, 2, 'Sentinel\'s Companion', 411567, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411567, 6, 0, 'The companion of a night elf sentinel, rarely given out as a gift.', -1, 4096),
(411568, 15, 2, 'Puddle Terror', 411568, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411568, 6, 0, 'Living so closely to the water\'s surface, the puddle terror is not only friend to all aquatic creatures, it is one.', -1, 4096),
(411569, 15, 2, 'Soul of the Forge', 411569, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411569, 6, 0, 'When forging enchanted steel, bits of magic seep into the coals. Over a period of years, decades even, the unbound energy slowly takes form, creating a tiny elemental being of immense fortitude.', -1, 4096),
(411571, 15, 2, 'Albino River Calf', 411571, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411571, 6, 0, 'Their white hide would make them vulnerable to sunburn, if it wasn\'t as thick as plate armor.', -1, 4096),
(411572, 15, 2, 'Brilliant Bloodfeather', 411572, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411572, 6, 0, 'The bloodfeather is completely fearless, fanning out its feathers and charging any threat.', -1, 4096),
(411573, 15, 2, 'Golden Dawnfeather', 411573, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411573, 6, 0, 'It\'s said the feathers glitter like gold when the rising sun shines upon them.', -1, 4096),
(411574, 15, 2, 'Son of Sethe', 411574, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411574, 6, 0, 'Godlike being now in travel size.', -1, 4096),
(411576, 15, 2, 'Eye of Observation', 411576, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411576, 6, 0, 'You\'ll always feel like... something is watching you.', -1, 4096),
(411577, 15, 2, 'Bloodthorn Hatchling', 411577, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411577, 6, 0, 'Ravagers are favored ogre snacks when they are small and less deadly.', -1, 4096),
(411578, 15, 2, 'Frostshell Pincher', 411578, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411578, 6, 0, 'The frostshell pinchers build up layers of ice to give them the extra protection from larger predators.', -1, 4096),
(411579, 15, 2, 'Ironclaw Scuttler', 411579, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411579, 6, 0, 'With claws that can crush a platemail gauntlet, it\'s best to handle with care.', -1, 4096),
(411581, 15, 2, 'Fen Crab', 411581, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411581, 6, 0, 'These crafty crustaceans burrow under the mud to avoid being scooped up by larger predators.', -1, 4096),
(411582, 15, 2, 'Zangar Crawler', 411582, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411582, 6, 0, 'They feed off of the nutrient-rich fungal spores which gives these crabs the district coloring of their shells.', -1, 4096),
(411583, 15, 2, 'Kelp Scuttler', 411583, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411583, 6, 0, 'They will cover themselves in seaweed and other ocean foliage to get the upper claw on their prey.', -1, 4096),
(411594, 15, 2, 'Mudback Calf', 411594, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411594, 6, 0, 'Surprisingly quick when provoked, but easily calmed with a meal of Nagrand arrowbloom.', -1, 4096),
(411595, 15, 2, 'Flat-Tooth Calf', 411595, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411595, 6, 0, 'Surprisingly quick when provoked, but easily calmed with a meal of Nagrand arrowbloom.', -1, 4096),
(411598, 15, 2, 'Glowing Sporebat', 411598, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411598, 6, 0, 'Wild sporebats are vicious creatures, but if tamed at a young age, they can be loyal companions.', -1, 4096),
(411599, 15, 2, 'Shadow Sporebat', 411599, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411599, 6, 0, 'Wild sporebats are vicious creatures, but if tamed at a young age, they can be loyal companions.', -1, 4096),
(411601, 15, 2, 'Servant of Demidos', 411601, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411601, 6, 0, 'Demidos created a great many servants when he was hosting parties for other void lords.', -1, 4096),
(411602, 15, 2, 'Grommloc', 411602, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411602, 6, 0, 'No matter how much he screams, never give him demon blood.', -1, 4096),
(411603, 15, 2, 'Argi', 411603, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411603, 6, 0, 'Often caught chewing on things they shouldn\'t be, goats were initially blamed for the crash of the Exodar.', -1, 4096),
(411615, 15, 2, 'Parched Lizard', 411615, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411615, 6, 0, 'Not only is it quick, it\'s loud too!', -1, 4096),
(411628, 15, 2, 'Sister of Temptation', 411628, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411628, 6, 0, 'She\'s the devil on your shoulder, whispering in your ear.', -1, 4096),
(411629, 15, 2, 'Stinkrot', 411629, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411629, 6, 0, 'What\'s that smell?', -1, 4096),
(411639, 15, 2, 'Graves', 411639, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411639, 6, 0, 'In one invasion of the Haunted Mines, a team of heroes only managed to collect a single skull. The golem that resulted, too small to do much damage to the enemy towers, wandered off into the Nexus, eventually finding its way to Azeroth.', -1, 4096),
(411655, 15, 2, 'Slithershock Elver', 411655, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411655, 6, 0, 'The rivers of Draenor are filled with moray. They are vicious predators, attacking anything that enters the water.', -1, 4096),
(411656, 15, 2, 'Young Talbuk', 411656, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411656, 6, 0, 'Talbuk grow their horns to full size at an early age.', -1, 4096),
(411660, 15, 2, 'Fel Pup', 411660, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411660, 6, 0, 'These pups are bundles of fur and teeth until they grow up, at which point they are really just teeth.', -1, 4096),
(411661, 15, 2, 'Lost Netherpup', 411661, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411661, 6, 0, 'Rumor has it that some beasts that were touched by the void exist in a space between this world and the next.', -1, 4096),
(411662, 15, 2, 'Cinder Pup', 411662, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411662, 6, 0, 'Found munching on a blackened bone in the Black Forge of Blackrock Foundry, this pup really seems to warm up to you quickly.', -1, 4096),
(411663, 15, 2, 'Periwinkle Calf', 411663, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411663, 6, 0, 'These playful little riverbeasts enjoy scooping up a large mouthful of water and then spitting it at one another.', -1, 4096),
(411664, 15, 2, 'Nightmare Bell', 411664, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411664, 6, 0, 'Once a holy artifact used by draenei priests to calm spirits, it has become animated by anguished souls and drawn to locations of death and corruption.', -1, 4096),
(411665, 15, 2, 'Ghostshell Crab', 411665, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411665, 6, 0, 'These crabs have developed an advanced form of camouflage that causes their skin to appear translucent.', -1, 4096),
(411672, 15, 2, 'Corrupted Nest Guardian', 411672, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411672, 6, 0, 'There is very little difference between a corrupted nest guardian and an omelette chef.', -1, 4096),
(411687, 15, 2, 'Left Shark', 411687, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411687, 6, 0, 'Who would leave such a cute shark behind? The Iron Horde truly has no soul.', -1, 4096),
(411688, 15, 2, 'Crusher', 411688, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411688, 6, 0, 'Found wandering in a small blizzard, this lost goren carries a mining pick to show that he is a jack of all trades.', -1, 4096),
(411690, 15, 2, 'Shard of Cyrukh', 411690, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411690, 6, 0, 'A small amount of Cyrukh burns everlasting within this portion of the Cipher. Best keep it close to you.', -1, 4096),
(411691, 15, 2, 'Nibbles', 411691, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411691, 6, 0, 'This young stalker was easily swayed from Sargeras\' grasp by a handful of Magical Mini-Treats.', -1, 4096),
(411692, 15, 2, 'Savage Cub', 411692, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411692, 6, 0, 'Pets often look a lot like their owners, which is especially true if the owner was a saberon.', -1, 4096),
(411693, 15, 2, 'Blazing Firehawk', 411693, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411693, 6, 0, 'Arakkoa sun worship has resulted in the creation of some strange and monstrous minions.', -1, 4096),
(411699, 15, 2, 'Enchanted Cauldron', 411699, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411699, 6, 0, 'Strega the Hag enchanted her cauldron to prevent it from tipping over and spilling hot soup. She never expected it to achieve sentience and attempt to murder her.', -1, 4096),
(411700, 15, 2, 'Enchanted Torch', 411700, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411700, 6, 0, 'Strega the Hag didn\'t like carrying her own torches. One quick enchantment, and the thing would dutifully follow her into the night.', -1, 4096),
(411701, 15, 2, 'Enchanted Pen', 411701, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411701, 6, 0, 'Strega the Hag, tired of writing thank you notes, used her magic to automate the task. Unfortunately, the pen had a dark side and all the recipients received strongly worded letters...', -1, 4096),
(411705, 15, 2, 'Grumpy', 411705, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411705, 6, 0, 'You saved him, but maybe he saved you.', -1, 4096),
(411708, 15, 2, 'Albatross Chick', 411708, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411708, 6, 0, 'Many sailors believe that harming an albatross will bring terrible luck upon their voyage.', -1, 4096),
(411709, 15, 2, 'Fledgling Kingfeather', 411709, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411709, 6, 0, 'While other species of birds take turns leading the flock during migration, the kingfeather always remains in the lead. Whether this is an effort to help the rest of the flock conserve energy or out of dominance remains unknown.', -1, 4096),
(411710, 15, 2, 'Fledgling Oliveback', 411710, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411710, 6, 0, 'Always in its brother\'s shadow.', -1, 4096),
(411711, 15, 2, 'Skyhorn Nestling', 411711, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411711, 6, 0, 'A very rare bird, but this one was intrusted to you.', -1, 4096),
(411712, 15, 2, 'Golden Eaglet', 411712, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411712, 6, 0, 'These birds often prey on turtles by dropping them from great heights to break open their shell.', -1, 4096),
(411713, 15, 2, 'Long-Eared Owl', 411713, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411713, 6, 0, 'Its eyesight is better than its hearing.', -1, 4096),
(411714, 15, 2, 'Northern Hawk Owl', 411714, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411714, 6, 0, 'Its sharp eyes can spot a snowshoe rabbit in a snowstorm.', -1, 4096),
(411715, 15, 2, 'Nightwatch Swooper', 411715, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411715, 6, 0, 'These creatures can hunt in almost pure darkness.', -1, 4096),
