(411735, 15, 2, 'Terror Larva', 411735, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411735, 6, 0, 'The terror larva seeks a host to feed on their dreams and terrors. Soon the larva will grow into the host\'s worst fears.', -1, 4096),
