(411753, 15, 2, 'Bleakwater Jelly', 411753, 3, 64, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 55884, -1, 411753, 6, 0, 'When a helsquid has devoured most of the food in any area, it can return to its polyp form and begin life anew.', -1, 4096),
